TT 2142 "Shu atrofda qandaydir tovush eshitildi. Qani ko'raylik-chi..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 2143 "A?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER__M__5
TT 2144 "Bu nima edi?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER__M__6
TT 2145 "Nima?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER__M__7
TT 2146 "Hoy!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER__M__8
TT 2147 "Bu qanday ovoz?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2148 "Bu ovozni nimaligini bilishim kerak..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2149 "Yana qanday ovoz bo'ldi bu?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2150 "Men jinni emasman. Men nimadur eshitdim..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 2151 "A?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__5
TT 2152 "Bu nima edi?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__6
TT 2153 "Nima?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__7
TT 2154 "Hoy!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__8
TT 2155 "Nima... Borib yaqinroqdan ko'rishim kerak!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 2156 "Qiziq bo'ldi-ku... Yaqinroq borishim kerak shekilli..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 2157 "Bu nima ekanligi haqida biror fikring bormi? Men buni tekshirib ko'raman!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 2158 "Buni kim qilganini ko'rdingmi? Men ularni topaman!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 2159 "Men rostdan ham nimadur ko'rdim! Yaqinroq boraman." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2160 "Nimadur ko'rdim. Qani ko'ramiz..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2161 "Bunaqasini hech ko'rmaganman... Balki yaqinroq borib ko'rarman?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2162 "Nima bo'ldi? Buni tushunishim kerak..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 2163 "Ishongim kelmaydi, yana shularmi? Bu safar ularni albatta topaman!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 2164 "Hoy! Ular qaytib kelishga jur'at etishdimi? Borib bir qarayman!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 2165 "Hoy! Nazarimda ular qaytib kelishdi! Borib qidiraman!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 2166 "Ha! Yana senmi? Men seni to'xtataman, ko'rasan..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2167 "Hoy! Sen qaytishga ju'rat qildingmi? Qimirlama, men kelyapman..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2168 "Oh, Sen qaytingmi? Yaxshi! Sen bilan yana bahslashamiz..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2169 "Xuddi qamchi ovoziga o'xshadi... Borib tekshirib ko'raman!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 2170 "U yerdan nimadir tarsillaganini eshitdim! Qani ko'raylik-chi!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 2171 "Aniq aytishim mumkinki, bu cho'zma edi. Bir daqiqa kuting..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 2172 "Shu yerni tekshiraman. Qandaydir tovush eshitdim!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 2173 "A? Bu qamchi ovozi bo'lishi mumkin emas-ku, shundaymi?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2174 "Nimadir tarsilladi... Shu tarafdanmi?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2175 "Voy! Bu cho'zma edimi? Bir daqiqa..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2176 "Nima... Bu qanday tarsillagan ovoz edi?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 2177 "Anavi yerda, ko'rdingizmi? Borib yaqinroqdan qarayman!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 2178 "Uni ko'rdingizmi? Kutinglar borib tekshiraman..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 2179 "Bu g'alati... Borib tekshirganim yaxshi!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 2180 "Anavi yerda, ko'rdingizmi? Borib qarayman..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 2181 "Bu... o'sha emasmidi? Borib ko'raman..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2182 "Nimadir qimirladimi? Yaqinroqdan ko'rishim kerak..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2183 "U yerda nimadir bor, bunga ishonchim komil..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2184 "Anavi yerdagi nima baland o'zi?" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 2185 "Sog'-omon qayt... Sen bizga bu yerda keraksan!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__1
TT 2186 "Extiyot bo'l! Nimadur g'alati..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__2
TT 2187 "Tirik qaytishga harakat qil!" VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__3
TT 2188 "Extiyot bo'l..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__4
TT 2189 "Ancha surbet ekansan, yosh xonim..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__1
TT 2190 "Unday bo'lsa, marhamat..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__2
TT 2191 "Buncha qizishmasangiz..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__3
TT 2192 "Hammangiz birin-ketin o'lasiz..." VO__ALCHEMIST1__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__4
TT 2193 "Prima Macula... Birinchi Bo'sag'a arafasida... Yo'ldan adashgan Tashuvchini domiga tortadi. Yoki uni jilovlaganning yonida hamroh bo'ladi. Xoja yoki qul... Tartib yoki tartibsizlik... Ammo bunga qanday amin bo'lish mumkin?" VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_SHIFT_001__M__1
TT 2194 "Ularning uyalarini nazarda tutyapsizmi? Ular uyalarini qurish uchun bizning o'liklarimizdan foydalanishadimi?" VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__CHATTER_AUTOPSY_GATHERING_004__M__1
TT 2195 "Keling, duo qilaylik... Vitalisning Afsun marosimi haqiqatan ham amalga oshsin." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__CHATTER_AUTOPSY_GATHERING_006__M__1
TT 2196 "Hoy, pastdagilar! Distillat quyuqlashyapti! Tez orada filtrlarni almashtirish va baklarni qirib tozalash kerak bo'ladi!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__CHATTER_BARRELS_001__M__1
TT 2197 "Magistr, matnda Yustinian o'lati davridagi bolaning yuksalishi haqida aniq aytib o'tilgan." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__CHATTER_EPISANGUIS_CHAT_001__M__1
TT 2198 "Rim aslzodalari uni xalqdan ajratib, yashirincha sig'inishgan." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__CHATTER_EPISANGUIS_CHAT_003__M__1
TT 2199 "Sifati a'lo... ammo xom Episanguis miqdori kamayib boryapti. Bizning yig'im-terimchilarimiz kalamushlar tomonidan qirib tashlanyapti..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__CHATTER_EPISANGUIS_STOCKS_002__M__1
TT 2200 "Moddalar moddasi... Yagona oltin... Seni parchalab, yo'lingni ochaman... Tanlangan kishining qoniga boradigan yo'lni..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__CHATTER_PUSHING_WHEEL__M__1
TT 2201 "Bo'ldi." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__RTC_FAINTING_002__M__1
TT 2202 "Buni faqat Oliy Inkvizitor ayta oladi." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__RTC_FAINTING_004__M__1
TT 2203 "Mening so'zlarim... hech qanday ahamiyatga ega emas, faqat Oliy Inkvizitorning so'zlari muhim." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__RTC_FAINTING_006__M__1
TT 2204 "Ammo amin bo'ling... Siz u kishi uchun haqiqatdan ham juda qadrlisiz..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__RTC_FAINTING_007__M__1
TT 2205 "Bizda... Hyugo de Running qoni bor..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__RTC_HUMAN_CRUCIBLE_010__M__1
TT 2206 "Shunday... Afsuski, Janobi Oliylari, bola allaqachon birinchi bo'sag'aga yetishi kerak edi... biroq... uning qonidagi qandaydir narsa jarayonni sekinlashtirganga o'xshaydi. Makula hali ham boshlang'ich holatida." VO__ALCHEMIST2__CH11__RTC_HUMAN_CRUCIBLE_012__M__1
