TT 2269 "Bu yerda nimalar bo'lyapti o'zi?" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_AFAR__M__4
TT 2270 "Eh... Hushyorlikni yo'qotdingmi, jazosini tortasan..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_RATS__M__1
TT 2271 "Oh... U yetarlicha ehtiyotkor bo'lmagan ko'rinadi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_RATS__M__2
TT 2272 "Xudoyim-ey... Bir lahzalik e'tiborsizlik. Aqlingni ishlatishing kerak edi." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_RATS__M__3
TT 2273 "Yo tavba... Ehtiyotkorroq bo'lishing kerak edi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_RATS__M__4
TT 2274 "Bu yerda bittasi o'libdi. Aybdor uzoqqa ketmagan bo'lishi kerak! Uni toping!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH__M__1
TT 2275 "Ehtiyot bo'ling! Jasad hali issiq. Qotil yaqin atrofda bo'lishi kerak!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH__M__2
TT 2276 "Odamimiz yaralandi! Hammangiz, shay turing!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH__M__3
TT 2277 "Ehtiyot bo'ling! Odamlarimizdan biri yaralanibdi!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH__M__4
TT 2278 "Qotil! Seni yerning tagidan bo'lsa ham topaman!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH_ALONE__M__1
TT 2279 "Meni eshityapsanmi, surbet? Inkvizitsiya hech qachon unutmaydi!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH_ALONE__M__2
TT 2280 "Qayerda bo'lsang ham, kofir, seni baribir topaman..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH_ALONE__M__3
TT 2281 "Qotil, agar meni eshitayotgan bo'lsang, ruhing la'natga qolsin!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH_ALONE__M__4
TT 2282 "Hoy! Buni kim otdi?" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT__M__1
