TT 2289 "Kimdur menga o'q uzyapti! Soqchilar, buyoqqa!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH__M__4
TT 2290 "Buning haqqini to'laysan. Men vada beraman!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH_ALONE__M__1
TT 2291 "Hali shoshmay tur! Odamlarga azob berishni men ham bilaman..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH_ALONE__M__2
TT 2292 "Agarda seni topsam, voqealar sen bilan yaxshi tugamaydi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH_ALONE__M__3
TT 2293 "Bu yoqqa kel! Buning qanday bo'lishini senga ko'rsatib qo'yaman..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH_ALONE__M__4
