TT 2295 "To'xtat buni! Hoziroq!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_MISS__M__2
TT 2296 "Yo'q, yo'q, yo'q! Buni hali ko'ramiz!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_MISS__M__3
