TT 2322 "Ko'nglim joyiga tushdi!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME_WATCHER__M__4
TT 2323 "Davom etinglar, baribir ularni tutamiz!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH__M__1
TT 2324 "Davom eting — ular yaqin atrofda bo'lishi kerak!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH__M__2
TT 2325 "Hech kim ko'rinmayapti. Atrofni qidiring!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH__M__3
TT 2326 "Bu yer haqiqatdan ham xavfli. Olg'a!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH__M__4
