TT 2342 "Bosqinchilar! Hamma bu yoqqa!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_FOUND__M__4
TT 2343 "Seni topishimni bilardim!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_FOUND_ALONE__M__1
TT 2344 "Xo'sh! Endi bu vaziyatdan qanday qutulmoqchisan?" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_FOUND_ALONE__M__2
TT 2345 "Sen yutkazding! Sening o'yining tugadi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_FOUND_ALONE__M__3
TT 2346 "Aha! Sabr-toqatim, nihoyat, o'z mevasini berdi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_FOUND_ALONE__M__4
TT 2347 "Hech kim yo'q... G'alati." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_RETURN__M__1
TT 2348 "Hech kim qolmabdi. Qidirishni to'xtatinglar." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_RETURN__M__2
TT 2349 "Ular bu yerda yo'q. Ishga qaytinglar!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_RETURN__M__3
TT 2350 "To'xtash vaqti keldi. Hamma allaqachon ketib bo'libdi." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_RETURN__M__4
