TT 2381 "Ishongim kelmaydi... Hozirgina shu yerda edi-ku, shundaymi?" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2382 "Bunaqasini hech ko'rmaganman... Borib ko'rishim shart!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2383 "Nima? Ishonish qiyin! Buni yaqinroqdan borib ko'rishim kerak!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2384 "Buning qanday iloji bor? Bilishim kerak!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 2385 "Kimdir biz bilan o'yin qilyapti! Borib bir ko'raman!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__1
