TT 2387 "Xullas, kimdir buni to'xtatishi kerak... Men boraman!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 2388 "Kimdir men bilan o'yin o'ynayotganga o'xshaydi... Qani, ketdik..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2389 "Yana? Kim bor u yerda? Hozir borib seni tutaman!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2390 "Bu ortiqcha! Mening qanaqaligimni hali ko'rasan!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2391 "Bu qanaqa qarsillagan tovush bo'ldi? Borib tekshiraylik-chi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 2392 "Hu! Yaqin oradan keldi! Borib tekshirib kelaman!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 2393 "Xuddi qamchi ovoziga o'xshadi-ku! Borib ko'raman!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 2394 "Bu qarsillagan tovush juda yaqindan keldi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 2395 "Bu qanaqa qarsillash bo'ldi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2396 "Oho! Bu qarsillagan ovoz juda yaqin oradan chiqdi-ku..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2397 "Bu qamchi bo'lishi mumkin emas... To'xtab tur-chi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2398 "U qarsillagan tovush juda yaqin edi... Nima ekan u?" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 2399 "Nahotki bu... Anavi yerda nimadir ko'rdim. Qani ko'raylik-chi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 2400 "Bu o'sha... Borib ko'rishim kerak!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 2401 "Qimirlama! U yerda nimadur ko'rdim..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 2402 "Lekin... Baribir borib ko'raman!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 2403 "Bo'lishi mumkin emas... Har ehtimolga qarshi, tekshirib ko'rgan ma'qul..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 2404 "U yerda nimadir bordek ko'rinyapti... Aynan o'sha yerda..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 2405 "Ko'zlarim aldamayaptimi? Qani, ko'raylik-chi." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 2406 "Yana nima bo'ldi bu? Tekshirgan yaxshi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 2407 "Agar ishonch hosil qilmoqchi bo'lsang, borib ko'r!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__1
TT 2408 "Agar haqiqatan ham nimadir bo'lsa, bizga aytishni unutma!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__2
TT 2409 "Agar kim uchratib qolsang, o'zingni qahramon ko'rsatib o'tirma!" VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__3
TT 2410 "Ehtimol, u hech narsa emasdir, lekin... har ehtimolga qarshi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__4
TT 2411 "Seni aqlliroq deb o'ylagandim..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__1
TT 2412 "Sabr qil, sening ham navbating keladi..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__2
TT 2413 "Unda, birinchi navbat xonimlarga..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__3
TT 2414 "Keyingi safarni kutib tur..." VO__ALCHEMIST2__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__4
TT 2415 "Uning qoni zaiflashib bormoqda... Episangvis zararlanishni yana qancha vaqt ushlab tura oladi?" VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH7__CHATTER_AFTER_VITALIS_001__M__1
TT 2416 "Ulardan qo'rqishingizga hojat yo'q. Sinchkovlik bilan chatishtirish va ozgina alkimyo ularning instinktlarini jilovlab qo'ygan." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_ABOUT_RATS_002__M__1
TT 2417 "Parhezning tubdan o'zgarganini aytmasa ham bo'ladi." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_ABOUT_RATS_003__M__1
TT 2418 "Yaxshi xabarim bor... Nihoyat uni yerto'laga ko'chirishdi." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_ALCHEMIST_STUDIES_002__M__1
TT 2419 "Qanaqa maqsadda?" VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_AUTOPSY_GATHERING_002__M__1
TT 2420 "Umid qilamanki, shunday, chunki biz ishlab chiqara oladigan narsa faqat shu... Vitalisning organizmi shuncha miqdorda episangvisni qabul qila olishi mo'jizadir." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_BARRELS_002__M__1
TT 2421 "Tez orada. Jodu vaqti yaqinlashmoqda. Lekin Vitalisni o'yla. Uning azoblari oldida seniki hech narsa emas..." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_CONJURATION_002__M__1
TT 2422 "Men bilardim..." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_EPISANGUIS_CHAT_002__M__1
TT 2423 "Balki Hyugo de Running ajdodlaridan biridir... Davom eting!" VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_EPISANGUIS_CHAT_004__M__1
TT 2424 "Oliy inkvizitorning tanasi «Tishlash»ga dosh berolmayapti... Qo'rqamanki, u endi uning ongiga hujum qiladi." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_EPISANGUIS_VITALIS_001__M__1
TT 2425 "Iloho, uning ruhi omon qolsin... Ad Ignem." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_EPISANGUIS_VITALIS_003__M__1
TT 2426 "Ushbu xotirjamlikdan bahramand bo'l... Sening o'liming yakun emas, chunki qoning yangi farishtalar naslini oziqlantiradi... Ular sening farzandlaring... Sening g'ururing bo'ladi..." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_LAST_SACRAMENT_001__M__1
TT 2427 "Unga yana nima bo'ldi?" VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_PRISONER_SPOT_003__M__1
TT 2428 "Yaxshisi, u bir oz kutib tursin... Kalamushlar yangi so'yilgan go'shtni afzal ko'rishadi." VO__ALCHEMIST3__CH11__CHATTER_PRISONER_SPOT_007__M__1
