TT 2511 "Kimdur menga o'q uzyapti! Soqchilar, buyoqqa!" VO__ALCHEMIST3__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH__M__4
TT 2512 "Buning haqqini to'laysan. Men vada beraman!" VO__ALCHEMIST3__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH_ALONE__M__1
