TT 2784 "Ismimizni o'z kuchim bilan porlayman! Men ritsarning qiziman, shunchaki ipak sotuvchisi emas, buni isbotlayman ham. Chuv! Ortimdan, Lion! CHUV!" VO__AMICIA__CH1__RTC_HORSE_RUN_006__M__1
TT 2785 "Bu menman..." VO__AMICIA__CH1__RTC_HUGO_001__M__1
