TT 2813 "Senga va'da beraman — bugun kechqurun shohlardek ziyofat qilamiz!" VO__AMICIA__CH1__RTC_WINNER_006__M__1
TT 2814 "To'siq..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_1ST_BARRICADE_001__M__1
TT 2815 "Kimnidir kiritmaslik yoki chiqarmaslik uchun..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_1ST_BARRICADE_003__M__1
TT 2816 "Ancha yaxshi... Kerakli materiallar bo'lsa, uni yanada takomillashtirishim mumkin..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_ABOUT_SLING_CRAFTED__M__1
