TT 2824 "Ah, haligi... Kechirasiz..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_AMICIA_PRAYER_003__M__1
TT 2825 "Bu... Bu shunchaki dahshatli tush..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_AMONG_RATS_001__M__1
