TT 2945 "Shu yerdamisan!" VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INCOMING_HOSTILES_OK_007__M__1
TT 2946 "Qo'rqib ketgan edim..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INCOMING_HOSTILES_OK_009__M__1
TT 2947 "Bu mening aybim, sen haq eding." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INCOMING_HOSTILES_OK_011__M__1
TT 2948 "Barakalla. Men buni tushiraman... Ehtiyot bo'l!" VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INCOMING_HOSTILES_OK_012__M__1
TT 2949 "Tezroq... Bo'la qol..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INCOMING_HOSTILES_OK_012__M__2
TT 2950 "Ilojimiz yo'q... Lavrentiyisiz hech narsa qilolmaymiz." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INCOMING_HOSTILES_OK_16__M__1
TT 2951 "Tezroq... Tezroq..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INSIDE_SAFE_HOUSE_001__M__1
TT 2952 "Ular ichkariga kirib olishibdi..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INSIDE_SAFE_HOUSE_003__M__1
TT 2953 "Tegma unga, Hyugo. Tinch qo'y." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_002__M__1
TT 2954 "Ladun..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_003__M__1
TT 2955 "Onam undan foydalanar edilar..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_005__M__1
TT 2956 "Yo'q... Pivo hidi kelyapti... Uni o'zlari tayyorlashgan bo'lsa kerak..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_007__M__1
TT 2957 "Pivo hidi kelyapti... Uni o'zlari tayyorlashgan bo'lsa kerak..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_008__M__1
