TT 2959 "Ladun... Onam foydalanadigan ladunning xuddi o'zi..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_ALONE__M__1
TT 2960 "Tezroq! Bor kuching bilan qoch!" VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_KIDS_CHASED_002__M__1
TT 2961 "Bilmayman!" VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_KIDS_CHASED_2_002__M__1
TT 2962 "Kechirasiz, men Lord Robert de Runing qiziman! Bizga hujum qilishdi... Bizga yordam kerak!" VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_KNOCKING_1ST_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 2963 "Kimdur bormi? Yonimda kichik ukam bor! De Run mulkiga hujum qilishdi... Sizdan o'tinib so'rayman, bizga yordam bering!" VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_KNOCKING_2ND_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 2964 "Nimalar bo'lyapti o'zi?..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_KNOCKING_2ND_DOOR_002__M__1
TT 2965 "Kimdur bormi? Bizga yordam kerak!..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_KNOCKING_3RD_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 2966 "Hech kim bizni ichkariga kiritmaydi... Ularga nima bo'lgan o'zi?" VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_KNOCKING_3RD_DOOR_002__M__1
