TT 2971 "Iltimos... Yo'q..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_LAST_CHANCE_003__M__1
TT 2972 "Chiqish yo'li yo'q..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_LAST_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 2973 "Tinchlan, Amisiya... U yaxshi, sen ham yaxshisan... Diqqatingni jamla..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_LIGHTING_BRASEROS__M__1
TT 2974 "Qishloq zararlangan... Shuning uchun hamma yashiringan." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_MANY_CROSSES__M__1
