TT 2976 "Bu o'ylaganingdan ham jiddiyroq. Bu degani biz ham ularning kasalligini yuqtirib olishimiz mumkin, shuning uchun u yoq-bu yoqqa chopaverma!" VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_MARKED_DOORS_004__M__1
TT 2977 "Havo... tomog'imni achishtiryapti..." VO__AMICIA__CH2__CHATTER_NARROW_CORRIDOR_002__M__1
