TT 3412 "Juda xavfli... Bu yo'ldan..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_THIEVES_CAUGHT_007__M__1
TT 3413 "Men.... Men tushunaman..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_THREATENING_GUARD_003__M__1
TT 3414 "Qara, yana daraxtlar ko'rinyapti. Nazarimda, oxiriga yetib keldik." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_TO_THE_CASTLE_002__M__1
TT 3415 "Ha... Jasadlar..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_TOWER_DOOR_002__M__1
TT 3416 "Manjaniq... Bu urush quroli..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_TREBUCHET_002__M__1
