TT 3423 "Omon qolish uchun bo'lsa kerak... xuddi bizga o'xshab..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_TWINS_1ST_TIME_007__M__1
TT 3424 "Yo Xudoyim..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_VISTA_CARNAGE_001__M__1
TT 3425 "Biz davom eta olmaymiz..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_VISTA_CARNAGE_003__M__1
TT 3426 "Qani, buyog'iga piyoda yuramiz. Isib olasan..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_WAKE_UP__M__1
TT 3427 "Faqat to'xtama, Hyugo. Qani, yur..." VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_WALKING_DEAD_002__M__1
TT 3428 "Siz kimsiz?" VO__AMICIA__CH4__CHATTER_WITH_MELIE_001__M__1
