TT 3474 "U hazillashyapti, Hyugo..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_AQUEDUCT_007__M__1
TT 3475 "Yana olovdonlar! Men mudofaa devoriga chiqib olaman..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_AWAY_FROM_MELIE_002__M__1
TT 3476 "Biz buni uddalaymiz... Hyugo xavfsiz joyda bo'ladi. Hammamiz omon qolamiz..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_AWAY_FROM_MELIE_004__M__1
