TT 3541 "Yaxshi..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_HELMET_ON_005__M__1
TT 3542 "I... I..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_HELMET_SHOOT_002__M__1
TT 3543 "Xavotir olma, Hyugo..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_HOUSE_ON_CLIFF_004__M__1
TT 3544 "Kelyapman Hyugo! Seni qanday qilib narigi tomonga o'tkazishni o'ylayapman!" VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_HUGO_CANT_FOLLOW_002__M__1
