TT 3548 "Taqa!" VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_002__M__1
TT 3549 "Boy bo'lmasligimiz mumkin, lekin ozgina omad xalaqit bermasdi..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_004__M__1
TT 3550 "Butun okrug xaritasi..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_006__M__1
TT 3551 "Nima? Shumi?... Bu yerda hech narsa yo'q-ku..." VO__AMICIA__CH5__CHATTER_INTO_THE_MOUNTAIN_001__M__1
