TT 3995 "Yaxshi... Yaxshi!" VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_PILLAR_004__M__1
TT 3996 "Yo'q, ular to'planishyapti!" VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_SHAPE_002__M__1
TT 3997 "Bola, onasining qo'lida... Lekin... Uning ko'kragidagi bu belgilar, Lukas..." VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_FRESCO_001__M__1
