TT 4001 "Lukas!" VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_SHAPE_001__M__1
TT 4002 "Lukas, yana bir freska... Homilador ayol..." VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_3RD_FRESCO_001__M__1
TT 4003 "Bu... qandaydir distillash apparatiga o'xshaydi, to'g'rimi? U alkimyogarmi?" VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_3RD_FRESCO_003__M__1
