TT 4006 "Ehtimol uning og'zida..." VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_ACTIVATE_LION_001__M__1
TT 4007 "Bizga yordam ber, Ona..." VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_ACTIVATE_LION_002__M__1
TT 4008 "Qani ko'ramiz...." VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_ACTIVATING_BRASERO_1_001__M__1
