TT 4011 "Men sen bilanman... lekin biz harakatdan to'xtamasligimiz kerak." VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_AFTER_CHASE_004__M__1
TT 4012 "Xmm Lukas... Biz yolg'iz emasmiz!" VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_AFTER_THE_RUSH_002__M__1
