TT 4016 "Oh, ajoyib!" VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_AMONG_RATS_1_001__M__1
TT 4017 "Uya! Ular atrofimda... va men hech narsani ko'rmayapman!" VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_AMONG_RATS_1_003__M__1
