TT 4021 "U o'ziga munosibini oldi." VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_APPROACH_004__M__1
TT 4022 "Biz uddaladik, Lukas! Uddaladik!" VO__AMICIA__CH9__CHATTER_ARRIVED_001__M__1
