TT 4226 "Ha onajon..." VO__AMICIA__CH10__CHATTER_ARRIVAL_HUGOROOM_003__M__1
TT 4227 "Ahvoli qanday?" VO__AMICIA__CH10__CHATTER_ARRIVAL_HUGOROOM_005__M__1
