TT 4229 "Lekin..." VO__AMICIA__CH10__CHATTER_ARRIVAL_HUGOROOM_009__M__1
TT 4230 "Uni ko'rishimga ruxsat bering..." VO__AMICIA__CH10__CHATTER_ARRIVAL_HUGOROOM_011__M__1
TT 4231 "Bu... qishloqmi? Shu yerdami?" VO__AMICIA__CH10__CHATTER_ARRIVAL_VILLAGE_001__M__1
