TT 4329 "Bo'laqol... Bundan ham yomoniga duch kelganmiz-ku..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_BRASERO_RIDE_1_004__M__1
TT 4330 "Iltimos, tezroq!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_BRASERO_RIDE_2_002__M__1
TT 4331 "Birma-bir... Birma... bir..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_BRASERO_RIDE_2_006__M__1
TT 4332 "Qanday qilib xandaq to'lib toshishi mumkin? Bunday bo'lmagan edi hech qachon!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_BRASERO_SET_002__M__1
TT 4333 "Xa! Boshladik!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_BRINGING_ARTHUR_BACK_001__M__1
TT 4334 "Bundan tezroq harakat qilolmayman!..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_BRINGING_ARTHUR_BACK_003__M__1
TT 4335 "Ular qayta yig'ilishyapti! Olovni o'chirishmoqchi!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_FIRST_SHAPES_002__M__1
TT 4336 "Eplayman!... Buni oldin ham qilganman..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_FIRST_SHAPES_004__M__1
TT 4337 "Oh yo'q, yo'q! Tez!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_FIRST_SHAPES_005__M__1
TT 4338 "Oh... Bu yerda nima qilyapsan? Qishning ayni o'rtasi-ku..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_FLOWER_CLOSE_001__M__1
TT 4339 "Hyugo seni topishi kerak edi..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_FLOWER_INTERACT_002__M__1
TT 4340 "Hyugo... Bu u edi! Bu Hyugo edi!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_GARDEN_003__M__1
TT 4341 "Ular unga nima qilishdi?... Kalamushlar... U... u..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_GARDEN_005__M__1
TT 4342 "Bu narsalar... Har bir joyni eslayman... Har bir lahzani..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_GIFTS_FURNITURE__M__1
TT 4343 "Eshiting, men Hyugo bilan gaplashishim kerak... Men qila olaman..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_HALLWAY_004__M__1
TT 4344 "Argx! Ular narvonni buzib tashlashibdi! Men qal'a devoridagisiga yetib borishim kerak!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_IN_THE_PIT_001__M__1
TT 4345 "Oldin shunday edi!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_IN_THE_PIT_003__M__1
TT 4346 "U Buyuk Ishni yaratdim deb o'ylaganidagi Lukasning yuzi... Va Hyugo... 'Barakalla Lukas! Sen sehrgarsan!'" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_ALCHEMY_TABLE__M__1
TT 4347 "Sen ham yolg'izsan, to'g'rimi? Qani, jilmay... Yana bir kun..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_AMICIAS_NECKLACE__M__1
TT 4348 "Hech qachon bunchalik ko'p olmamiz bo'lmagan edi... Hyugo ularni yeb o'zini kasal qilgan bo'lardi..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_APPLES__M__1
TT 4349 "Qor tufayli Rodrik hamon ishlay olgani yo'q..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_COLLAPSED_MESS__M__1
TT 4350 "O'ylashimcha, Rodrik hovlida ishlayapti..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_FORGE__M__1
TT 4351 "Hyugo... Meni kechir..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_HUGO_STUFF__M__1
TT 4352 "Lukas tunni yana shu yerda o'tkazdi... Bu unga Lavrentiy bilan yashagan paytlarini eslatsa kerak." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_LAB_MATRESS__M__1
TT 4353 "Lukas kitob yig'ishni bas qilishi kerak... Oxiri ular hamma joyni egallab oladi." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_LIBRARY__M__1
TT 4354 "Qulf hali ham muzlaganmi?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_LUCAS_001__M__1
TT 4355 "Ozgina..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_LUCAS_003__M__1
TT 4356 "Ha..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_LUCAS_005__M__1
TT 4357 "Hammasi joyida Lukas, bu menga kerak emas. Men uni sog'inyapman, xolos. Men... uning qaytmasligini qabul qilishim kerak." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_LUCAS_007__M__1
TT 4358 "Men boshqalarni ko'rgani boraman." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_LUCAS_009__M__1
TT 4359 "Sandiqmi? Albatta." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_LUCAS_011__M__1
TT 4360 "Meli... Hammasi joyidami? Artur bilan demoqchiman?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_001__M__1
TT 4361 "O'zimni mashg'ul qilishga urinyapman... Aytgancha, olovlarni yoqish vaqti ham bo'lib qoldi." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_003__M__1
TT 4362 "Ha onajon..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_005__M__1
TT 4363 "Kechirasiz... Xalaqit bermayapmanmi?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_ARTHUR_001__M__1
TT 4364 "Eshiting... Tez orada qorong'u tushadi va biz olovlarni yoqishimiz kerak... Menga yordam bera olasanmi, Artur?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_ARTHUR_004__M__1
TT 4365 "Hey... Ahvoling yaxshimi?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_RODRIC_001__M__1
TT 4366 "Bu ancha... shiddatli bo'ldi..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_RODRIC_003__M__1
TT 4367 "Oh... Men yaxshiman..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_RODRIC_005__M__1
TT 4368 "Rodrik... Buning foydasi yo'q. Bir oy bo'ldi axir. Kelinglar... shunchaki xandaqni tunga tayyorlaylik, a?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_RODRIC_007__M__1
TT 4369 "Sho'rva... Navbat kimniki edi? Meli? Yo'q, uning hidi yetarlicha qalampirli emas..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_SOUP_CHIMNEY__M__1
TT 4370 "Kechirasiz... Agar siz... agar siz Hyugo qayerdaligini bilsangiz... shafqat qilib menga ayting... yoki iloji bo'lsa, unga g'amxo'rlik qiling..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_TOMB_CANDLES__M__1
TT 4371 "Tez orada quyosh botadi... Umid qilamanki, Hyugo o'z joyidan buni ko'radi..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_VISTA__M__1
TT 4372 "Men kelayapman!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_LEAVE_WITHOUT_ARTHUR_002__M__1
TT 4373 "Shoshma nima? Yana qulflanganmi?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_LOCKED_AGAIN_001__M__1
TT 4374 "Oh, Lukasga sandig'i uchun yordam kerak!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_CHEST_YES_001__M__1
TT 4375 "Lukas bog'da... Yana nimani reja qilyapti ekan?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_GARDEN_003__M__1
TT 4376 "Yaxshi emas... Bu yaxshi emas..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_NEW_SHAPES_002__M__1
TT 4377 "Qizil hududdagi narvonga yetib borishim kerak... bo'lmasa shu yerda o'laman..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_NEW_SHAPES_003__M__1
TT 4378 "Qani... buni uddalaysan..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_PUSHING_BRASERO_001__M__1
TT 4379 "HA!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_PUSHING_BRASERO_002__M__1
TT 4380 "Yaxshi! U yerdan... pastda bo'lgandan ko'ra shu yerda bo'lishni afzal ko'raman!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_PUSHING_BRASERO_004__M__1
TT 4381 "Qayerdan bilay? Lekin xuddi ular... hujum qilayotgandek tuyuldi!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_PUSHING_BRASERO_006__M__1
TT 4382 "Lekin ular nima... qilayotganini bilishadi!... Men buni faqat bir marta ko'rganman... Uyda... Qasrimizda!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_PUSHING_BRASERO_008__M__1
TT 4383 "Qizil hududdagi narvon! Agar unga yetsak, minoraga o'ta olamiz." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_RATS_002__M__1
TT 4384 "Nihoyat... Xudoyim... Hech qachon yetib borolmaymiz deb o'ylagandim..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_REACH_LADDER_002__M__1
TT 4385 "Ha, raxmat! Endi hammasi senga bog'liq!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_REMPART_002__M__1
TT 4386 "Seni u yerga olib boraman!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_REMPART_004__M__1
TT 4387 "Xo'sh, biror mo'jiza ko'rsatdingmi?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_RODRIC_NO_INTERACT_001__M__1
TT 4388 "Qani, gulxanlarni joy-joyiga qo'yamiz. Boshlaymiz..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_START_BRASERO_001__M__1
TT 4389 "Kechirasan. Tunda xandaqning xavfsiz ekanligini bilish, menga yaxshiroq uxlashga yordam beradi, xolos..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_START_BRASERO_002__M__2
