TT 4391 "Rahmat sizga..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_START_BRASERO_006__M__1
TT 4392 "U seni yoqtirib qolgan bo'lardi." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_START_BRASERO_008__M__1
TT 4393 "Sen bizni qutqarding. Seni asirga olishdi, sen qochishga muvaffaq bo'lding. Xuddi kitobdagi qahramonga o'xshaysan o'ziyam." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_START_BRASERO_010__M__1
TT 4394 "Lekin u sening ketayotganingni ko'rib xafa bo'lardi." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_START_BRASERO_012__M__1
TT 4395 "Mana marhamat." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_STOP_BRASERO_001__M__1
TT 4396 "Xm... Hammasi joyidami, Rodrik?" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_STOP_BRASERO_004__M__1
TT 4397 "Hoy, tinchlan! Agar hammasini sindirib tashlasang..." VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_STOP_BRASERO_006__M__1
TT 4398 "Shunday niyatdaman!" VO__AMICIA__CH12__CHATTER_STOP_BRASERO_011__M__1
