TT 4433 "Uning gapi to'g'ri." VO__AMICIA__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_016__M__1
TT 4434 "O'ylashimcha... endi biz ko'pchilikmiz..." VO__AMICIA__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_019__M__1
