TT 4500 "Yetar shuncha, Vitalis! Sen yolg'izsan! Onamizni qaytar, bo'lmasa..." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_GATHERING_THE_RATS_008__M__1
TT 4501 "Hammasi joyida, Rodrik!" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_GUARDS_OK_001__M__1
