TT 4505 "Va uni tirik saqlab qolish uchun." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_HOW_IS_SHE_002__M__1
TT 4506 "Rodrik, u endi besh yoshda..." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_HOW_IS_SHE_004__M__1
TT 4507 "Inkvizitor qo'llanmasi..." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_000__M__1
TT 4508 "U Vitalisdan oldin yozilgan..." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_002__M__1
TT 4509 "Nima uchun?" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_005__M__1
TT 4510 "Oh, tushunarli..." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_007__M__1
TT 4511 "Sen tiriksan! Eshiting, Vitalis soborda!" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_LUCAS_MELIE_002__M__1
TT 4512 "Biz ortga qaytolmaymiz... Boravering! Siz bilan narigi tomonda ko'rishamiz!" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_LUCAS_MELIE_006__M__1
TT 4513 "Qani, ketdik. Uyga!" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_LUCAS_MELIE_008__M__1
