TT 4515 "Pastga tushsangiz, o'lasiz!" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_NEW_WAVE_003__M__1
TT 4516 "Unda ularga ayt, tashqariga chiqishsin, qani!" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_NEW_WAVE_006__M__1
TT 4517 "Rodrik..." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_OLD_TIMES_002__M__1
TT 4518 "Ahvolingni tushunib turibman... Lekin sen hali ham tiriksan. Va sening ildizlaring... Ular buni sendan hech qachon tortib ololmaydi..." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_OLD_TIMES_006__M__1
TT 4519 "Biz birga ketamiz... va boshqa qal'a topamiz." VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_OLD_TIMES_009__M__1
