TT 4533 "Bu yaxshi belgi, u zaiflashyapti!" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_RATSHAPE_FIRST_SUCCESS_1_002__M__1
TT 4534 "Navbat senga, Hyugo! Unga zarba ber!" VO__AMICIA__CH14__CHATTER_RATSHAPE_LAUNCH_001__M__1
