TT 5222 "Hyugo... Kalamushlar... Bu yagona yo'l!" VO__BEATRICE__CH11__CHATTER_FIRST_STEP_002__M__1
TT 5223 "Kechir meni, Hyugo!" VO__BEATRICE__CH11__CHATTER_FIRST_STEP_OK_002__M__1
TT 5224 "Hyugo, bu o'yin emas... Bu kuch xavfli. Sen o'zingni nazorat qilishing kerak." VO__BEATRICE__CH11__CHATTER_FLEEING_RATS_003__M__1
TT 5225 "Sen kasal emassan, Hyugo, bu... bu qobiliyat. Keyinroq tushuntiraman." VO__BEATRICE__CH11__CHATTER_FLEEING_RATS_006__M__1
TT 5226 "Uni qiynashni bas qiling! Siz bilishni xohlagan hamma narsani aytaman!" VO__BEATRICE__CH11__CHATTER_FOURTH_STEP_OK_002__M__1
TT 5227 "Ha! Barakalla! Tez kelaqol!" VO__BEATRICE__CH11__CHATTER_GOING_BACK_HOLE_002__M__1
TT 5228 "Juda ehtiyot bo'l... Kalitlarni olishing bilan qayt!" VO__BEATRICE__CH11__CHATTER_KEY_OBJECTIVE_001__M__1
TT 5229 "Yana bir soqchi..." VO__BEATRICE__CH11__CHATTER_KEYS_ROOM_001__M__1
