TT 5325 "Bola... Eshiting, o'g'lim cherkovdan yig'lab kelganida, uning oyog'idagi jaroxatni ko'rdim... Tishlash..." VO__CONRAD__CH2__CHATTER_CONRAD_INTRO_FIGHT_003__M__1
