TT 5554 "Hoy! Ular shu yerda bo'lsa kerak! Hamma joyni qidiringlar!" VO__GUARD1__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH__M__1
TT 5555 "Bosqinchi bo'lishi mumkin... Borib qara!" VO__GUARD1__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH__M__2
TT 5556 "Soqchilar! Kutilmagan mehmonlar bo'lishi mumkin! Borib ko'ring!" VO__GUARD1__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH__M__3
TT 5557 "Yetar shuncha! Hamma joyni qidiring! Ularni topish kerak!" VO__GUARD1__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH__M__4
TT 5558 "Agar asabimga tegishga urinayotgan bo'lsang, buni uddalading..." VO__GUARD1__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH_ALONE__M__1
TT 5559 "To'xta! Senga bunday o'ynashishni ko'rsatib qo'yaman!" VO__GUARD1__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH_ALONE__M__2
