TT 5569 "Hoy sen! Qayerga ketyapman deb o'ylayapsan?" VO__GUARD1__GENERIC__PATROL_ALERT_ALONE__M__4
TT 5570 "Omading bor ekan!" VO__Guard1__GENERIC__PATROL_ALERT_BLOCKED__M__1
TT 5571 "Qo'limga tushguningcha kutib tur..." VO__GUARD1__GENERIC__PATROL_ALERT_BLOCKED__M__2
