TT 5798 "Sendayam nimadir bo'lishi kerak... Qadrliroq narsa... Hammada ham ozgina xazina bo'ladi..." VO__Guard2__CH7__CHATTER_LIGHT_SITUATION_001__M__2
TT 5799 "Hoy! Bu nima balo?!" VO__Guard2__CH7__CHATTER_LIGHT_SITUATION_003__M__1
TT 5800 "Oching! Hoziryoq oching!" VO__GUARD2__CH7__CHATTER_LOCK_DOOR_005__M__1
TT 5801 "Bunga hali afsuslanasan... Biz seni topamiz!" VO__GUARD2__CH7__CHATTER_LOCK_DOOR_006__M__1
