TT 5940 "O'zingdan faxrlanyapsanmi, qotil? Buning uchun tovon to'laysan, aytib qo'yay..." VO__GUARD2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH_ALONE__M__2
TT 5941 "Eshitayapsanmi iflos? Seni shunday qiynaymanki..." VO__GUARD2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH_ALONE__M__3
TT 5942 "Buni kim qilgan bo'lsa ham... Yashiringaning ma'qul!" VO__GUARD2__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH_ALONE__M__4
