TT 6567 "Xudoyim... Diqqatni jamla... Faqat diqqatni jamla..." VO__GUARD4__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_RATS__M__2
TT 6568 "Oh yo'q... Men senga hech qachon xushyorlikni yo'qotma degandim-a?" VO__GUARD4__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_RATS__M__3
TT 6569 "Oh Xudoyim, ahvoling yaxshi emas... E'tiborliroq bo'lishing kerak edi..." VO__GUARD4__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_RATS__M__4
TT 6570 "Murda bor! Atrofni qidiring!" VO__Guard4__GENERIC__PATROL_CORPSE_SEARCH__M__1
