TT 8276 "Mening ustozim, shu bilan birga, avvalo buyuk alkimyogar. Isming Amisiya, shundaymi? Men Lukasman. Senga bir narsani ko'rsatmoqchi edim... lekin buning uchun spirt va oltingugurt kerak. Bu atrofda bo'lishi kerak. Ularni topganingda menga aytarsan." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_IGNIFER_003__M__1
TT 8277 "Yaxshi, endi ularni aralashtirishing kerak. Buni sekin qil. Bu xavfli emas." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_IGNIFER_006__M__1
TT 8278 "Falsafa... Men hatto shunday derdim... butun bir hayot... Alkimyogarning hayoti." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_006__M__1
TT 8279 "Xa! Xa! Xaaaa!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_LAST_RUSH_003__M__1
TT 8280 "Oh, cho'chqa go'shtlari... Yaxshi fikr!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_LIGHT_BLOCKER_001__M__1
TT 8281 "Fonuslar... Yaxshi. Qil buni!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_LIGHT_BLOCKER_003__M__1
TT 8282 "Hoy! Bunday qilma! Chiroqni o'chirsang, kalamushlar tomog'imizni uzib tashlaydi!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_LIGHT_WARNING_001__M__1
TT 8283 "Kelaqol, bu yerga!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_OPEN_TRAPDOOR_LAB__M__1
TT 8284 "Men eshikni yopaman..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_PIG_IN_BARN_004__M__1
TT 8285 "Ignifer! Uni cho'g'lar ustiga ot!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_RATS_ARE_BACK_002__M__1
TT 8286 "Oh yo'q... Ular qaytib kelishdi..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_RATS_IN_BARN_001__M__1
TT 8287 "Biz omborxonaning orqa tomoniga yetib olishimiz kerak... Biz ignifersiz keta olmaymiz! Buni qanday qilamiz?" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_RATS_IN_BARN_003__M__1
TT 8288 "Oh yo'q..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_RATS_IN_HOUSE_001__M__1
TT 8289 "Ular ichkariga kirishga muvaffaq bo'lishibdi!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_RATS_IN_HOUSE_001__M__2
TT 8290 "Voy!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_RATS_INVASION_001__M__1
TT 8291 "Hali emas! Ignifer Amisiya, vaqti keldi! Xonaning markazidagi cho'g'larni nishonga ol!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_RATS_INVASION_004__M__1
TT 8292 "Bax... Xavotir olma." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_SHOOT_LIGHT_FIRST_002__M__1
TT 8293 "U yerda... Tegirmonning narigi tomonida qayiq bor ekan!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_SURROUNDED_BY_RATS_004__M__1
TT 8294 "Lavrentiy..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_SWARM_OF_RATS_002__M__1
TT 8295 "Cho'g'larni nishonga ol, Amisiya!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_USE_IGNIFER_HELPER__M__1
TT 8296 "Ha! Aralashmang a'lo chiqdi!... Ona qanday bo'lsa, qizi ham shunday... Bilasanmi? Senga boshqa snaryadlarni ham yasashni ko'rsataman. Bu juda foydali bo'ladi." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_USE_IGNIFER_OK_004__M__1
TT 8297 "Men qorishmalarimni tugatdim, biz Lavrentiyning oldiga qaytishimiz kerak. Amisiya... Sen oldinda borishing kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__CHATTER_USE_IGNIFER_OK_006__M__1
TT 8298 "Yonda narvon bor. Qani ketdik." VO__LUCAS__CH3__FEEDBACK_CLOSED_BARN_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 8299 "Tushunarli. Senga yordam berishga ruxsat ber." VO__LUCAS__CH3__FEEDBACK_PULL_SACK_002__M__1
TT 8300 "Ikkalangiz ham yaxshimisiz?" VO__LUCAS__CH3__FEEDBACK_RATS_ATTACK_HAM_003__M__1
TT 8301 "Xmm... Bu unchalik foyda bermadi..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__FEEDBACK_RELEASE_SACK_002__M__1
TT 8302 "Bizga go'sht kerak... O'lik yoki tirik." VO__LUCAS__CH3__HELPER_PIG_PUZZLE_001__M__1
TT 8303 "Ah, chiroqlar..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__HELPER_PIG_PUZZLE_LIGHTS_001__M__1
TT 8304 "Oh yo'q!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_BURNING_FARM_004__M__1
TT 8305 "Amisiya, kalamushlar!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_BURNING_FARM_005__M__1
TT 8306 "No! NO!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_BURNING_FARM_007__M__1
TT 8307 "USTOZ!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_BURNING_FARM_010__M__1
TT 8308 "Distillash baklari!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_BURNING_FARM_011__M__1
TT 8309 "Biror narsa qiling!" VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_BURNING_FARM_013__M__1
TT 8310 "Ustoz..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_BURNING_FARM_015__M__1
TT 8311 "Sen kimsan?" VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_MEETING_LAURENTIUS_001__M__1
TT 8312 "O'sha joyda to'xta! U yuqumli..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_MEETING_LAURENTIUS_003__M__1
TT 8313 "Ular shu yerda." VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_MEETING_LAURENTIUS_013__M__1
TT 8314 "Gapirishga urinmang! Men o'zimni isbotlayman..." VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_MEETING_LAURENTIUS_015__M__1
TT 8315 "Ota-onang uchun afsusdaman... Lekin sen endi yolg'iz emassan. Biz tez harakat qilishimiz kerak. Igniferni tayyorlashda yordam berishing mumkin, u bizni kalamushlardan himoya qiladi." VO__LUCAS__CH3__RTC_MEETING_LAURENTIUS_016__M__1
TT 8316 "Bunisi biroz boshqacharoq ko'rinyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_ANOTHER_MACHINE_002__M__1
TT 8317 "Agar biz akvedukka ergashsak, qorong'i tushguncha Ombraj qal'asiga yetib borishimiz kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_AQUEDUC_001__M__1
TT 8318 "U yaxshiga o'xshaydi..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_AQUEDUC_004__M__1
TT 8319 "G'ildiraklar loyga botib qoldi..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_CART_STOP_001__M__1
TT 8320 "Biroz, ha..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_CASTLE_002__M__1
TT 8321 "Xux... U o'zini issiq tutyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_CASTLE_004__M__1
TT 8322 "Oh!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_COLLAPSING_AQUADUC_002__M__1
TT 8323 "Harakatlanishda davom etishimiz kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_CORNERED_004__M__1
TT 8324 "Oh, hid... bunga chidab bo'lmaydi..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_CROSS_BATTLEFIELD_002__M__1
TT 8325 "Lekin bizda tanlov yo'q..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_DEAD_END_005__M__1
TT 8326 "Qara, u yerda biroz pichan bor ekan! Sen uni yoqa olishing kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_DRY_CROPS_001__M__1
TT 8327 "Lekin bu ishladi..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_DYING_GUARD_002__M__1
TT 8328 "Amisiya... U yerda kimdir bor ekan..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_ENTERING_TOWER_002__M__1
TT 8329 "U yerda o'tin borligini ko'ryapman... Lekin bu oson bo'lmaydi." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_FIND_LIGHT_002__M__1
TT 8330 "Xux... Biz uni orqaga ushlab turmayapmizmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_FLAMING_CART_GO_002__M__1
TT 8331 "Bunga unchalik ishonchim komil emas..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_FLAMING_CART_GO_004__M__1
TT 8332 "Yaxshi. Ishladi." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_FLAMING_CART_GO_006__M__1
TT 8333 "Ular yana nima edi?..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_FLOWER_INTERACT_002__M__1
TT 8334 "Ah ha, albatta!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_FLOWER_INTERACT_004__M__1
TT 8335 "Qaysi yo'ldan borishimiz kerak?..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_FROM_ABOVE_001__M__1
TT 8336 "Bu yerdagi ko'rgan hamma narsangni e'tiborsiz qoldirishga harakat qil, Hyugo..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_HANGED_003__M__1
TT 8337 "Uddalading!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_HEROES_RETURN_001__M__1
TT 8338 "Dastaklardan biri singan... lekin u hali ham harakat qila oladi deb o'ylayman." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_HOW_IT_WORKS_002__M__1
TT 8339 "Makula..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_HUGO_STRESS_004__M__1
TT 8340 "Hammaning ham qilich sotib olishga yetarli puli yo'q..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_003__M__1
TT 8341 "Menimcha u Olifant deb ataladi. Bu odam ehtimol kapitan bo'lgan." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_INTERACT_ARTIFACT_005__M__1
TT 8342 "Biz buni o'zimiz qilamiz Amisiya..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_LOSING_TORCH__M__1
TT 8343 "Akveduk ostidan o'tishimiz kerak, Amisiya... Lekin kalamushlar hamma joyda..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_NEED_LIGHT_001__M__1
TT 8344 "Amisiya, mash'alang bizni fosh qiladi! Yaxshisi uni tashla!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_NO_ATTENTION_001__M__1
TT 8345 "Oh yo'q!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_OPEN_TOWER_002__M__1
TT 8346 "Bu masofani hisoblaydigan vosita..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_PICKUP_GIFT_002__M__1
TT 8347 "Ular otish burchaklarini sozlash uchun undan foydalanishsa kerak." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_PICKUP_GIFT_004__M__1
TT 8348 "Yo'q, unday emas!... Keyinroq ko'rsataman!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_PICKUP_GIFT_006__M__1
TT 8349 "Juda ko'p shovqin qilyapmiz! Ular bizni payqab qolishadi!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_001__M__1
TT 8350 "Kuyib qolmaslikka ehtiyot bo'l..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_003__M__1
TT 8351 "Men... Men bilmayman..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_RATS_IN_HORSE_002__M__1
TT 8352 "Bunga ishonmayman!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_RATS_IN_HORSE_005__M__1
TT 8353 "Lekin tezroq bo'lishimiz kerak." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_RELEASE_TREBUCHET_003__M__1
TT 8354 "Bu yolg'on..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_REMORSE_001__M__1
TT 8355 "Hidni sezyapsanmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SHIELD_008__M__1
TT 8356 "Ha... Juda sassiq..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SHIELD_010__M__1
TT 8357 "Uf... Haqiqatan ham badbo'y..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SMELL_REMINDER_002__M__1
TT 8358 "Oh yo'q, askarlar!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIERS_001__M__1
TT 8359 "U yerda bitta askar bor... Yo'lni to'sib turibdi..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SOMNUM_001__M__1
TT 8360 "Boshqa ilojimiz yo'q - uni to'satdan dog'da qoldirishimiz kerak." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SOMNUM_003__M__1
TT 8361 "Ma, shuni ol." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SOMNUM_003__M__2
TT 8362 "Somnum. O'zing ko'rasan... Ularni aralashtir..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SOMNUM_005__M__1
TT 8363 "Ajoyib. Endi buni uning yuziga urib sindirasan." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SOMNUM_007__M__1
TT 8364 "Ha, bir muddatga..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_SOMNUM_OK_003__M__1
TT 8365 "Nima qilamiz?" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_THIEVES_CAUGHT_006__M__2
TT 8366 "Amisiya, uning fonusi..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_THREATENING_GUARD_002__M__1
TT 8367 "Nihoyat..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TO_THE_CASTLE_003__M__1
TT 8368 "Anavi yerda, minorada... Ular jasadlar, shundaymi?" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TOWER_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 8369 "Buni uzoq vaqt ushlab turolmaymiz!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TREBUCHET_EFFORT_001__M__1
TT 8370 "Oh... Qo'llarim.. Uvushib qolyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TREBUCHET_EFFORT_END_002__M__1
TT 8371 "Biz yo'lni tozalashimiz kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TREBUCHET_ORDER_004__M__1
TT 8372 "Ehtiyot bo'l..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TREBUCHET_ORDER_E3_004__M__1
TT 8373 "Men urinib ko'raman!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TURN_IT_DOWN_002__M__1
TT 8374 "Men buni tashlayman, ehtiyot bo'l!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TURN_IT_DOWN_003__M__1
TT 8375 "Bular o'g'rilar edi... o'g'irlash uchun narsalar qidirishgan." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_TWINS_1ST_TIME_005__M__1
TT 8376 "Biz hech qachon o'tolmaymiz... Bizga olov kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_UP_HERE_001__M__1
TT 8377 "Amisiya.. Biz akveduk bo'ylab yurishimiz SHART..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__CHATTER_VISTA_CARNAGE_004__M__1
TT 8378 "Tegirmon esingdami?... Trebushetning qo'li yonuvchanga o'xshaydi..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__HELPER_ARM_ON_FIRE_001__M__1
TT 8379 "Arava... Balki undan foydalana olarmiz..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__HELPER_FLAMING_CART_002__M__1
TT 8380 "Amisiya... Qara, ular qanday qilib o'sha tomonga tortilyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__HELPER_HANGED_001__M__1
TT 8381 "Osilib turgan jasadlar... O'ylashimcha, ular bizga kerak bo'ladi..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__HELPER_HANGED_DOWN_001__M__1
TT 8382 "Yashirinish uchun uzun o'tlardan foydalanib o'tib keta olishimiz kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__HELPER_HERBS_001__M__1
TT 8383 "Amisiya... trebushet... O'tish uchun undan foydalanishing mumkin..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__HELPER_RELEASE_TREBUCHET_001__M__1
TT 8384 "Kalamushlar juda ko'p. Biz qamalib qoldik!" VO__LUCAS__CH4__HELPER_TOWER_001__M__1
TT 8385 "Ha?" VO__LUCAS__CH4__RTC_LANDING_003__M__1
TT 8386 "Bir... eski hikoya bor... Unda Prima Makula haqida aytiladi... Alkimyogarlar uni birinchi illat bo'lgan deyishadi... va u ba'zi oilalarning qonida jimgina aylanib yuradi." VO__LUCAS__CH4__RTC_LANDING_005__M__1
TT 8387 "Lekin nimadir sodir bo'ldi... Buyuk Tanaffus... va Makula uyg'ondi... Hyugoning qonida." VO__LUCAS__CH4__RTC_LANDING_006__M__1
TT 8388 "Makula yaxshilikni ham, yomonlikni ham tanlamaydi... U o'z xo'jayini bilan birga rivojlanadi... narsalarni... dunyoni o'zgartirish uchun... Bilasanmi... onang va Lavrentiy ukangga yordam berishga harakat qilishgan..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__RTC_LANDING_008__M__1
TT 8389 "Yo'q... Menimcha, ularning vaqti tugagan xolos." VO__LUCAS__CH4__RTC_LANDING_010__M__1
TT 8390 "Mana shu..." VO__LUCAS__CH4__RTC_LANDING_011__M__1
TT 8391 "Nihoyat... Biz oxir-oqibat bilib olamiz..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_AQUEDUCT_IN_SIGHT_002__M__1
TT 8392 "Meli? Ukang qayerda?" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_BROTHER_001__M__1
TT 8393 "Xm... Yaxshi." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_BROTHER_003__M__1
TT 8394 "Baxtsiz hodisami?" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_CART_REMAINS_002__M__1
TT 8395 "Kalamushlar..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_CART_REWARD_002__M__1
TT 8396 "Oh! Amisiya! Menda sen uchun nimadir bor... Bu Igniferning qoldig'i... Lyuminosa. Uni kalamushlar to'dasiga tashlaysan va... xullas, o'zing ko'rasan. Ma, ol buni!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_CART_REWARD_005__M__1
TT 8397 "Anavi minora, u yashash joyi! U bir necha asrlik bo'lishi kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_CASTLE_COURT_003__M__1
TT 8398 "O'tishning boshqa yo'li bo'lishi kerak." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_CASTLE_COURT_006__M__1
TT 8399 "Yaxshimisan?" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_CHIT_CHAT_002__M__1
TT 8400 "Meli, eshit... Senga yolg'on gapirganim uchun kechir... Men Amisiya va Hyugo o'lishi mumkin deb o'yladim va... qo'rqib ketdim, men..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_CHIT_CHAT_004__M__1
TT 8401 "Adolatdan!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_CHIT_CHAT_006__M__1
TT 8402 "Mantiqqa to'g'ri keladi... Inkvizitsiya... Ular alkimyogarlik yozuvlarini o'qimasdan turib Makulagacha yetib bora olmasdilar. Ular nima qilishmoqchiligini bilmayman, lekin nima bo'lsa ham bu aravalar foydali bo'ladi." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_EPIC_LOOT_005__M__1
TT 8403 "Anavi osilgan gulxan xandaq bo'ylab harakatlana oladi..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_EPIPHANY_001__M__1
TT 8404 "Bunisi esa, boshqa tomonga..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_EPIPHANY_003__M__1
TT 8405 "Bu mudofaa tizimi!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_EPIPHANY_005__M__1
TT 8406 "Kalamush qopqoniga o'xshaydi! Nimadir himoya qilinyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_EPIPHANY_007__M__1
TT 8407 "Juda oson! Gulxanlar kalamushlarni chuqurga itaradi va ular u yerda qamalib qoladi!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_EPIPHANY_009__M__1
TT 8408 "Hammasi joyida, qo'yib yuborishing mumkin!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_FERRY_DOCKED_REVERSE_002__M__1
TT 8409 "Biz kelyapmiz!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_FERRY_DOCKED_REVERSE_003__M__1
TT 8410 "Bilmadim, lekin u juda qadimiyga o'xshaydi!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_FIRST_THOUGHTS_002__M__1
TT 8411 "Selitra, spirt va teri... Ularni aralashtir!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_GOT_ALL__M__1
TT 8412 "Bino... Ishonish qiyin. Odamlar bir vaqtlar bu yerda yashagan." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_HOUSE_ON_CLIFF_002__M__1
TT 8413 "Yaxshi. Yur Hyugo." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_HUGO_DOWN_003__M__1
TT 8414 "Yo'q yo'q yo'q... Lavrentiy bundan aqlliroq edi... Bu alkimyogarning hiylasi... 'Oltin qo'rg'oshindan tug'iladi', 'Eshik faqat kaliti bor odamgagina ochiladi'... Shunga o'xshash narsa." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_INTO_THE_MOUNTAIN_003__M__1
TT 8415 "Qoyilmaqom. E, Amisiya?" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_INTO_THE_MOUNTAIN_005__M__1
TT 8416 "Qildingmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUCAS_AGAIN_001__M__1
TT 8417 "Omad!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUCAS_AGAIN_006__M__3
TT 8418 "Hoy! Seni yana ko'rganimdan juda xursandman!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUCAS_GUARD_SHOT_004__M__1
TT 8419 "Hoy! Yaxshi ko'rinyapsan!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUCAS_GUARD_SHOT_008__M__1
TT 8420 "Haqlisan, ketdik! Qal'a endi uzoqda bo'lmasligi kerak." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUCAS_GUARD_SHOT_012__M__1
TT 8421 "Menga nima qilmoqchisizlar?" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUCAS_THREATENED_002__M__1
TT 8422 "Va... Keyin-chi?" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUCAS_THREATENED_004__M__1
TT 8423 "Men... Kim haqida gapirayotganingizni umuman bilmayman..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUCAS_THREATENED_006__M__1
TT 8424 "Uni kalamushlarga qarata ot!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUMINOSA_001__M__1
TT 8425 "Bum! Lyuminosa!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUMINOSA_002__M__1
TT 8426 "E... Bu kalamushlar uchun bo'lishi kerak edi, Amisiya..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUMINOSA_MISS_001__M__1
TT 8427 "Qara, yana bitta yasash uchun bu yerdagilar yetarli." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUMINOSA_MISS_001__M__2
TT 8428 "Hoy, Amisiya... Shularni ol. Lyuminosasiz o'tolmaymiz." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_LUMINOSA_REMINDER__M__1
TT 8429 "Menda shubha paydo bo'lgandi, lekin bu... Bu menga yoqadigan turdagi alkimyogar afsonasi... Qani, yaqinroqdan ko'rib chiqaylik!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_OMBRAGE_004__M__1
TT 8430 "A, ha... ha!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_ORDER_FERRY_004__M__1
TT 8431 "Ko'rinishidan og'ir kunlarni boshdan kechganga o'xshaysan..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_OUT_OF_CAMP_001__M__1
TT 8432 "Sen bu kelishuvni qabul qilmagan bo'larding..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_OUT_OF_CAMP_003__M__1
TT 8433 "Buni hal qilamiz..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_OUT_OF_CAMP_005__M__1
TT 8434 "Reaksiya paromi..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_REACTION_FERRY_001__M__1
TT 8435 "Qo'l bilan tortiladigan arqon yordamida harakatlanadigan qayiq." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_REACTION_FERRY_003__M__1
TT 8436 "Buni kim qurgan?" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_SECOND_THOUGHTS_001__M__1
TT 8437 "Menimcha, ritsarlar tosh va qorishmadan qanday foydalanishni bilishmagan... Lekin hunarmandlar... va ular juda ko'p bo'lgan..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_SECOND_THOUGHTS_003__M__1
TT 8438 "Haqlisan... Va bu... etimni jimirlatib yuboryapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_SECOND_THOUGHTS_005__M__1
TT 8439 "Oh..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_THE_CAVE_002__M__1
TT 8440 "Yo'q, shunchaki yer ostida to'plangan suv..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_THE_CAVE_005__M__1
TT 8441 "Hoy, u yerda ponton bor!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_THE_CAVE_005__M__2
TT 8442 "Xo'sh, agar bilishni istasang... oldin narigi tomonga o'tishimiz kerak." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_THE_CAVE_009__M__1
TT 8443 "Bu... Yo'q, bo'lishi mumkin emas..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_THE_TRENCH_003__M__1
TT 8444 "Buni yaqinroqdan ko'rishim kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_THE_TRENCH_003__M__2
TT 8445 "U... U chuqur..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_THE_TRENCH_004__M__2
TT 8446 "Ombraj qal'asi..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_THUNDER_END_003__M__1
TT 8447 "U uzoqda..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_TOO_LONG_001__M__1
TT 8448 "Amisiya! Bu yerga! Pastda yog'och parchalari bor ekan!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_UP_AGAIN_003__M__1
TT 8449 "Qara, gulxan..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_VISTA_DEFENSE_001__M__1
TT 8450 "Qani ko'raylikchi, uni yoqa olarmikinman..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_VISTA_DEFENSE_003__M__1
TT 8451 "Mendan hech narsa ololmaysan, bilib qo'y..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_WAITING_BRIDGE_002__M__1
TT 8452 "Agar meni qo'yib yuborsangiz, men..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_WAITING_BRIDGE_004__M__1
TT 8453 "Oh... Yaxshi..." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_WAITING_BRIDGE_006__M__1
TT 8454 "Buning sababi, uning ichida juda ko'p narsalar yashaydi." VO__LUCAS__CH5__CHATTER_WHAT_A_WORLD_002__M__1
TT 8455 "Ajoyib! Ketdik!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__HELPER_FINALLY_DONE_001__M__1
TT 8456 "Ha! Olov oldiga kel! Isinib ol!" VO__LUCAS__CH5__RTC_SAFE_AGAIN_009__M__1
TT 8457 "Shaharda ehtiyot bo'ling! Ehtimol, u yerdagi ahvol bu yerdagidan ko'ra betartibroqdir..." VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_GOODBYE_001__M__1
TT 8458 "Bunga ishonchim komil... Nima bo'lganda ham omad!" VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_GOODBYE_003__M__1
TT 8459 "Ah yo'q, yo'q! Oltingugurt juda ko'p! Quyosh oyni to'ldirish o'rniga, uning ustidan hukmronlik qilyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_001__M__1
TT 8460 "Oh, mana qayerdasan!" VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_003__M__1
TT 8461 "Mizg'iganim ham yo'q! Bu laboratoriya yomon ahvolda, lekin u meni ilhomlantirdi! Men Buyuk Ishni yakunlash arafasidaman! Va sen... sen menga yordam bera olasan!" VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_005__M__1
TT 8462 "Amisiya, menga chap tomondagi stoldan shisha idish kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_007__M__1
TT 8463 "Bu sening yo'lingni yoritadigan Eliksir! Makula tashuvchisi uchun mayoq! U kechasi hayolimga keldi!" VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_010__M__1
TT 8464 "E, ha! Konsentrlangan dafna shirasi. U shundoq orqamda!" VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_012__M__1
TT 8465 "So'nggi qadam uchun bizga yorug'lik kerak... Hyugo, borib sham olib kel!" VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_015__M__1
TT 8466 "Yaxshi... demak... farishta ko'z yoshi. Alkimyoning cho'qqisi..." VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_019__M__1
TT 8467 "Er..." VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_021__M__1
TT 8468 "U bunday bo'lishi kerak emas edi..." VO__LUCAS__CH6__CHATTER_LUCAS_LAB_023__M__1
TT 8469 "Mana! Va yana bir so'nggi narsa... Lavrentiy bir marta menga aytgandi.... kitobga olib boradigan yo'lda atirgullar sochilgan bo'ladi, shuning uchun ko'zingni ochib yur." VO__LUCAS__CH6__RTC_DEPARTURE_002__M__1
TT 8470 "Ha... Makula uning qoni orqali tarqalyapti. Kitoblarda aytilishicha, bu jarayonda bir nechta chegaralar bor va har bir chegarada tashuvchi halok bo'lishi mumkin ekan..." VO__LUCAS__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_004__M__1
TT 8471 "Juda kam... Hyugo birinchi chegaraga yaqinlashyapti. Mening ustozim va onang bu jarayonni sekinlashtirishga harakat qilishgan." VO__LUCAS__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_006__M__1
TT 8472 "Ular unga tayyorgarlik ko'rish uchun vaqt beradigan juda murakkab eliksir ustida ishlashayotgan edi..." VO__LUCAS__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_008__M__1
TT 8473 "Menda ularning bilimi yo'q... lekin ularning ishlari taqiqlangan kitob.. Sanguinis Itineradan ilhomlangan edi." VO__LUCAS__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_010__M__1
TT 8474 "Afsuski yo'q... Sanguinis Itinera xavfli. U boshqa asarlar bilan birga Universitet yerto'lasida muhrlab qo'yilgan... va u yerga borishning o'zi deyarli imkonsiz... hatto o'z joniga qasd qilish bilan barobar." VO__LUCAS__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_012__M__1
TT 8475 "Unday bo'lsa, senga ba'zi uskunalar kerak bo'ladi. Men ularni tayyorlayman." VO__LUCAS__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_017__M__1
TT 8476 "Ko'rinishidan kimdir vaqtini yaxshi o'tkazyapti!" VO__LUCAS__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_022__M__1
TT 8477 "Demak, uddalabsan-" VO__LUCAS__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_003__M__1
TT 8478 "Ah... Sanguinis Itinera!" VO__LUCAS__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_007__M__1
TT 8479 "It's..." VO__LUCAS__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_009__M__1
TT 8480 "It's..." VO__LUCAS__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_009__M__2
TT 8481 "Kelyapman!" VO__LUCAS__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_015__M__1
TT 8482 "Amisiya! Tez kel! Bu Hyugo!" VO__LUCAS__CH8__CHATTER_LUCAS_001__M__1
TT 8483 "Qani! Tezroq!" VO__LUCAS__CH8__CHATTER_LUCAS_004__M__2
TT 8484 "Tezroq!" VO__LUCAS__CH8__CHATTER_LUCAS_006__M__1
TT 8485 "Ahvoli borgan sari yomonlashyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_001__M__1
TT 8486 "Buni tushunib turibman, Amisiya... Qo'limdan kelganini qilyapman! Men... aytmoqchimanki, kitobda yozilganini qilishga urinyapman... lekin bu juda ko'p vaqt oladi. Menga haqiqiy laboratoriya kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_003__M__1
TT 8487 "Yo'q yo'q... Yaxshiroq uskunali laboratoriya!" VO__LUCAS__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_005__M__1
TT 8488 "U yerda qandaydir uskunalari bo'lishi kerak... Haqlisan. Urinib ko'rishga arziydi..." VO__LUCAS__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_007__M__1
TT 8489 "Hatto uning tirikligi ham!? Bu unga yordam berishi mumkin..." VO__LUCAS__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_022__M__1
TT 8490 "Keyingi chegara... U yaqinlashyapti!" VO__LUCAS__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_025__M__1
TT 8491 "Yaxshi, men Sanguinis Itinera va ba'zi damlamalarni olaman, keyin ketamiz." VO__LUCAS__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_029__M__1
TT 8492 "Rim freskasi... O'xshaydi... Yustinian vabosiga... Lavrentiy menga bu haqida aytib bergandi. Haqiqiy qirg'in..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_FRESCO_002__M__1
TT 8493 "Aytish qiyin. Bu oltinchi asrda bo'lgan...." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_FRESCO_004__M__1
TT 8494 "Bu freska tasodifan bu yerda emas va biz ham." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_FRESCO_006__M__1
TT 8495 "Ana, marhamat!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_PILLAR_001__M__1
TT 8496 "Qo'shimcha mahsulotlar! Stabilizatorlar! Reagentlar! Noyob materiallar! Yotoqxonada ko'rganimizdan ancha ustun." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_PILLAR_003__M__1
TT 8497 "Mana o'sha, Amisiya!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_PILLAR_003__M__2
TT 8498 "Xm... Ular ketishdimi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_SHAPE_001__M__1
TT 8499 "Demoqchisanki - Oh yo'q..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_1ST_SHAPE_003__M__1
TT 8500 "Prima Makula..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_FRESCO_002__M__1
TT 8501 "Va shunga qaramay... Bu oldin ham sodir bo'lgan..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_FRESCO_004__M__1
TT 8502 "Kim biladi? Sanguinis Itinera... 'Qon sayohatlari'... Makula tarix bo'ylab sayohat qiladi... U allaqachon dunyoni o'zgartirgan va buni yana qiladi." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_FRESCO_006__M__1
TT 8503 "Amisiya... Bu onang qo'li bilan yozgan eslatmalar!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_PILLAR_001__M__1
TT 8504 "U yerda! Nimadir borga o'xshaydi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_PILLAR_003__M__1
TT 8505 "Yana bir freska!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_PILLAR_004__M__1
TT 8506 "'...yangi transformatsiyani sinab ko'rdim, lekin eliksir to'liqsiz... Tashuvchining Mash'alasi g'oyib bo'lib, o'g'limni makula zulmatida qoldiryapti...' U to'g'ri yo'lda edi, Amisiya. Biz qidirayotgan narsa aniq shu yerni qayeridadir bor!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_PILLAR_005__M__1
TT 8507 "Biz bu yerda qololmaymiz!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_2ND_SHAPE_002__M__1
TT 8508 "Lekin bu hammasi emas, qara, uning yonida..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_3RD_FRESCO_002__M__1
TT 8509 "Xuddi shunday. Alkimyo ko'pincha homiladorlikka o'xshatilgan. Tigel yoki xumdon esa bachadonga." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_3RD_FRESCO_004__M__1
TT 8510 "Shunchaki emas... Bu... 'ma'bad'... onangniki. Va buning ayol kishi ekanligi shunchaki tasodif emas. Bu muhim joy." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_3RD_FRESCO_006__M__1
TT 8511 "Qani yur. Sen uning sirini ochding, Amisiya. Bunga munosibsan." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ACTIVATE_LION_003__M__1
TT 8512 "Tinchlan! Lavrentiy shunday der edi: 'Yurak urishini tinchlantir, chunki qo'llar yurakning xohishini ifodalaydi'. Shunday ekan, O'ZINGNI BOS!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ACTIVATING_BRASERO_1_002__M__1
TT 8513 "Mendan so'rasang, bu tasodif emas..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ACTIVATING_BRASERO_1_004__M__1
TT 8514 "Sal qoldi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_AFTER_CHASE_001__M__1
TT 8515 "O'takam yorilay deb qoldi, Amisiya..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_AFTER_CHASE_003__M__1
TT 8516 "Ularning tizimi juda yaxshi ishlayapti!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_AFTER_THE_RUSH_001__M__1
TT 8517 "Oh..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_AFTER_THE_RUSH_003__M__1
TT 8518 "Ishga qaytish vaqti keldi!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ALAMBICS_ON_001__M__1
TT 8519 "Nima qilayotganimni bilaman! Menimcha, shunday! Nima bo'lganda ham orqaga yo'l yo'q!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ALAMBICS_ON_003__M__1
TT 8520 "Barcha kosalar yondi. Endi qaytishing mumkin!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ALL_SYMBOLS_OK_001__M__1
TT 8521 "Parchalanish, Tozalanish va Sublimatsiya. Qurbaqa, Oqqush va Ilon. Demak..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ALL_SYMBOLS_OK_002__M__1
TT 8522 "Hoy! U yerda pastda ahvol qanday?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_AMONG_RATS_1_002__M__1
TT 8523 "Rangning biroz o'zgarishi. Yaxshi... Yaxshi, lekin yetarli emas!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ANOTHER_CONDITION_001__M__1
TT 8524 "Ayirish uchun qo'shishing kerak! Gulxan, Amisiya! Men uchun distilatorlarga yo'l ochishing kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ANOTHER_CONDITION_003__M__1
TT 8525 "U hali ham tirik!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_APPROACH_002__M__1
TT 8526 "I... I..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ARRIVED_002__M__1
TT 8527 "Ha, lekin... O'ylashimcha... men boshqa hech qachon yurolmayman..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ARRIVED_004__M__1
TT 8528 "Oh yo'q! Yur, ketdik..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ARRIVED_006__M__1
TT 8529 "Senga yo'l ko'rsatishga harakat qilaman!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BELOW_1_002__M__1
TT 8530 "Yorug'lik! Men kosalar yonida kutaman! Omad!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BELOW_1_004__M__1
TT 8531 "Endi deyarli yetib kelding!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BELOW_1_006__M__1
TT 8532 "E... Nima deyishni ham bilmayman... Shu yergacha yetib kelamiz deb hech o'ylamagandim... O'zimni shu yerda ko'raman deb... Lavrentiy menga dunyo haqida kitoblar orqali o'rgatgan edi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BELOW_1_008__M__1
TT 8533 "Buning eng yomoni shundaki... Bularning hech biri haqiqiy emasdek tuyuladi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BELOW_1_010__M__1
TT 8534 "Men... tushundim... Bu ular paydo bo'lgan birinchi joylardan biri bo'lishi kerak. Lekin bu ularning xatti-harakatlarini tushuntirmaydi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BLOCKED_PATH_RATS_002__M__1
TT 8535 "Yana kalamushlar..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BODY_TREE_002__M__1
TT 8536 "Damlamalarni topamiz va ketamiz. Tong otguncha uyga qaytishimiz ham mumkin." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BRIDGE_DOWN_002__M__1
TT 8537 "U xavfli emas edi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BUDDY_GUARD2_KILLED_001__M__1
TT 8538 "Sen ularni o'ldirishing mumkin edi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_BUDDY_GUARD2_SPARED_001__M__1
TT 8539 "Ishonmayman. Ularga qara... Xuddi daryoga o'xshaydi... Kalamushlar daryosi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_CART_001__M__1
TT 8540 "Shoshma... Arava! Biz olovni qayta yoqib, uni itarishimiz va..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_CART_003__M__1
TT 8541 "Nima? O'zim bir o'zimmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_CART_005__M__1
TT 8542 "Yaxshi, yaxshi! Lekin o'q-dorilaringni tayyorlab qo'y... Chunki biz bularning barchasini bekorga qilganimiz yo'q..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_CART_007__M__1
TT 8543 "Nima bo'lsa bo'lar." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_CART_GO_002__M__1
TT 8544 "Amisiya! Yur, bu yerga!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_COME_ON__M__1
TT 8545 "Bu... Bu qutida feniks tasviri bor... Buyuk alkimyoviy ishning ramzi... Amisiya, o'ylashimcha uni topdik. Uni och..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_DAT_BOX_001__M__1
TT 8546 "Sen bitta ramzdan uzoqda emassan!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_DIRECTION_HELP_1_001__M__1
TT 8547 "Sen boshqa ramzga yaqinlashyapsan! Davom et!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_DIRECTION_HELP_2_001__M__1
TT 8548 "O'q-dorilaringni teja. Men buni hal qilaman." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_DISCOVER_LAB_002__M__1
TT 8549 "U Alkimyo Ustasi edi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_DISCOVER_LAB_004__M__1
TT 8550 "U uchun xavfli bo'lgan deb o'ylayman... Hech narsa topolmaganmiding?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_DISCOVER_THERMS_002__M__1
TT 8551 "Lekin bu safar ikkimiz... va sen endi yosh bola emassan. Uni topamiz." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_DISCOVER_THERMS_004__M__1
TT 8552 "VOALYA! Quyosh eshigi! Tashuvchi mash'alasi! Amisiya, meni qaytarib olib bor!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_DISTILLATION_END_001__M__1
TT 8553 "Xmm... Bu yerdan o'tolmaymiz..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_EDGE_OF_BRIDGE_000__M__1
TT 8554 "Bu eski dunyoning oxiri..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_EDGE_OF_BRIDGE_002__M__1
TT 8555 "Yo'q! Mash'alani yoqishim kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_EMERGENCE_BEATRICE_DESK_002__M__1
TT 8556 "Oh yo'q! Hozir emas! Tezroq, ustun!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_EMERGENCE_BRASERO_002__M__1
TT 8557 "Oh yo'q..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ENTER_FIRST_SHAPE_001__M__1
TT 8558 "Hech qanday fikrim yo'q! Ularni orqaga sur! Ignifer!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ENTER_FIRST_SHAPE_003__M__1
TT 8559 "O'qiyapman! Onang Quyosh eshigida to'xtab qolgan... U mash'alani topgan, lekin uni qanday yoqishni bilmagan..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ENTER_THE_RATS_002__M__1
TT 8560 "Bu ramzlar! U yetishmayotgan elementni qidirgan, lekin kitobda aytilishicha, 'Ruh bilan to'ldirish uchun idishni bo'shatishing kerak'... Onang xato qilgan! Biz qo'shishimiz emas, ayirishimiz kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ENTER_THE_RATS_004__M__1
TT 8561 "Men tushunaman. Men sen bilanman." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_FACING_GATE_002__M__1
TT 8562 "Kechir... Juda afsusdaman, Amisiya..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_FATHER_GONE_INTERACT_002__M__1
TT 8563 "Deyarli yetib keldim!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_FINAL_COUNTDOWN_002__M__1
TT 8564 "Menga biroz vaqt kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_FINAL_COUNTDOWN_004__M__1
TT 8565 "Bilaman, ularni eshityapman!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_FINAL_COUNTDOWN_006__M__1
TT 8566 "Yorug'lik! Bizga yorug'lik ber!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_FINAL_COUNTDOWN_008__M__1
TT 8567 "Oddiy damlamalar. Yetarlicha kuchli emas." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_FIND_POTS_1_002__M__1
