TT 8583 "Ular hali ham o'sha yerdami?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_INTERACT_FIRECAMP_002__M__1
TT 8584 "Sen mash'alani olishing kerak." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_KEEP_TORCH_001__M__1
TT 8585 "Rahmat...." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_KEEP_TORCH_003__M__1
TT 8586 "Amisiya..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_KILL_GUARD_001__M__1
TT 8587 "Shoshma... Fonus! Qo'shinlarni o'tkazish uchun shundan foydalanishgan bo'lishi kerak." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LANTERN_001__M__1
TT 8588 "Pastga qaytishing mumkin. Tayyor bo'lganingda aytarsan!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LANTERN_003__M__1
TT 8589 "Amisiya.... Men o'ylab qoldim va... O'ylashimcha..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LAST_STRAIGHT_LINE_002__M__1
TT 8590 "Barcha bu... hujumlar..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LAST_STRAIGHT_LINE_004__M__1
TT 8591 "Bu shuning uchunki, biz... Biz to'g'ri..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LAST_STRAIGHT_LINE_006__M__1
TT 8592 "Yo'lni ochdim Amisiya! Ketishimiz kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LIGHT_GOAL_001__M__1
TT 8593 "Rahmat!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LOCK_OPEN_002__M__1
TT 8594 "Ana! Eshik!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LOCKED_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 8595 "Yopiq... Boshqa tomonda zanjir bor..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LOCKED_DOOR_001__M__2
TT 8596 "Men xonani yoritaman, sen kalamushlar bilan shug'ullanasan!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LUCAS_HELP_002__M__1
TT 8597 "Yur! Shundoq orqangdaman!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LUCAS_ON_FIRE_001__M__1
TT 8598 "Kechirasiz! Men bu yerda Alkimyoviy Ishlar bilan bandman!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LUCAS_ON_FIRE_003__M__1
TT 8599 "Meni unutmanglar!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_LUCASS_TURN_002__M__1
TT 8600 "Demak... birinchi bo'lib buni yoqamiz..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_MIND_PALACE_001__M__1
TT 8601 "Keyin, mis kosani isitamiz..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_MIND_PALACE_002__M__1
TT 8602 "Ichidagi suyuqlikni aylantiramiz... Qani!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_MIND_PALACE_003__M__1
TT 8603 "'Va haqiqat og'izdan oqib chiqadi'... Qani, menga eng toza spirtingni ber!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_MIND_PALACE_004__M__1
TT 8604 "Men aralashmani tayyorlagunimcha, menga biroz matserat topib ber! Bu atrofda bo'lishi kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_NEED_STUFF_001__M__1
TT 8605 "Farmakopeyada! Pardali taxmonda!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_NEED_STUFF_003__M__1
TT 8606 "Ular ko'payib ketdi!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_NEXT_SHAPES_1_001__M__1
TT 8607 "Olov yoqishda davom et!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_NEXT_SHAPES_1_003__M__1
TT 8608 "Qayerga borishni taklif qilasan? Ular hamma joyda!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_NEXT_SHAPES_2_002__M__1
TT 8609 "Yoqish kerak bo'lgan yana bitta ramz qoldi!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ONE_SYMBOL_LEFT__M__1
TT 8610 "Menimcha, uni saqlab qolganingdan u ta'sirlangan bo'lardi." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PICKUP_GIFT_002__M__1
TT 8611 "Ha! Bu Tozalanish!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PURIFICATION_SYMBOL_002__M__1
TT 8612 "Ramz paydo bo'ldi! Bu Sublimatsiya!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PURIFICATION_SYMBOL_003__M__1
TT 8613 "Ah! Xudoyim... bu haqiqatan ham... og'ir ekan!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_001__M__1
TT 8614 "Ahh! Men bu yerda o'lishni xohlamayman... Arava itarib." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_2_001__M__1
TT 8615 "Xuddi... bu shunday qaror qilingandek... tanishganimizdan beri... hayotimizni... Xaos boshqaryapti!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_2_003__M__1
TT 8616 "Men... shunday qilyapman!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_2_005__M__1
TT 8617 "Ha! 'Harakat'? Unutma, men butun umrimni... yerto'lada o'tkazganman..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_003__M__1
TT 8618 "Oyoqlarim... og'riyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_3_002__M__1
TT 8619 "Qo'limdan kelgan... hammasini qilyapman!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_3_004__M__1
TT 8620 "Oyoqlarimdagi... muskullar... rozi emas..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_005__M__1
TT 8621 "Yo'q, rahmat... Tushundim..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUSHING_CART_007__M__1
TT 8622 "Alkimyoviy hayvonlar! Chirish, Tozalanish, Amalgamatsiya va Sublimatsiya! Kosadagi ramz ham Chirishni anglatadi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUZZLE_INTRO_001__M__1
TT 8623 "Uchta ramz, to'rtta haykal... Buning tagida olov bor ekan..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUZZLE_INTRO_002__M__2
TT 8624 "Xmmm... Ularga yetib borishning iloji bo'lishi kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUZZLE_INTRO_006__M__2
TT 8625 "Anavi yerda, ramz yonida... Plitalar o'pirilgan. Menimcha, o'tib keta olasan!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUZZLE_INTRO_006__M__3
TT 8626 "Yaxshi!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_PUZZLE_INTRO_008__M__1
TT 8627 "Amisiya! Ular... Ular gulxanni o'chirmoqchi!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_RAT_SHAPE_APPEAR_ALAMBICS_001__M__1
TT 8628 "Davom et! Deyarli yetib keldik!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_RAT_SHAPE_APPEAR_INGREDIENT_002__M__1
TT 8629 "KET!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_RAT_SHAPE_APPEAR_LUCASONFIRE_001__M__1
TT 8630 "Buni tatib ko'rchi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_RAT_SHAPE_APPEAR_LUCASONFIRE_003__M__1
TT 8631 "Ular nima bo'layotganini bilishadi, lekin Tarix oqimini o'zgartirmaydilar!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_RAT_SHAPE_APPEAR_LUCASONFIRE_006__M__1
TT 8632 "Ularning hammasi shu yerda to'planyapti..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_REACH_FLOOR_000__M__2
TT 8633 "Amisiya... Zirhsiz jasad..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_REACTION_DEAD_SERVANT_001__M__1
TT 8634 "Ha... ular ulardan qochyapti." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_REACTION_DEAD_SERVANT_2_002__M__1
TT 8635 "Ha... Soqchilar tiriklayin yeyilgan, lekin u yo'q." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_REACTION_DEAD_SERVANT_003__M__1
TT 8636 "Qaniydi bilsam... Buyuk Tanaffus... Uning oqibatlari vaqt o'tsa ham to'lqinlanishda davom etmoqda..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_REACTION_DEAD_SERVANT_005__M__1
TT 8637 "Boshladik! Harakatlanishing mumkin!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_READY_TO_GO_002__M__1
TT 8638 "Mensiz shu yergacha yetib kela olardim deb o'ylaysanmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_READY_TO_GO_004__M__1
TT 8639 "Demak... shu xolosmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_ROOM_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 8640 "Haqiqatan ham sasib ketganini top!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SEARCHING_POTION_002__M__1
TT 8641 "Yer qimirlayapti... Sezyapsanmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SHAPE_WARNING_1_001__M__1
TT 8642 "Ularni yaqinlashtirma!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SHAPE_WARNING_1_003__M__1
TT 8643 "Ular qayta to'planyapti!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SHAPE_WARNING_2_001__M__1
TT 8644 "Yana bittasi!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SHAPE_WARNING_3__M__1
TT 8645 "Ular qaytib kelyapti! Tezroq!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SHAPE_WARNING_4__M__1
TT 8646 "O'ylashimcha ha... Sen hayotimizni saqlab qolding." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SHAPES_END_002__M__1
TT 8647 "Qo'llaringdan foydalan Lukas... Uni isit... Uni jonlantir..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SHAPES_FINAL_PUSH_003__M__1
TT 8648 "Jin ursin... Ularga nima bo'ldi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SPIRAL_OF_RATS_002__M__1
TT 8649 "Balki juftlashish raqsidandir... Ba'zi hayvonlarning juda g'alati rituallari bor." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SPIRAL_OF_RATS_2_001__M__1
TT 8650 "Nega endi yo'q? Ular baribir hayvonlar." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SPIRAL_OF_RATS_2_003__M__1
TT 8651 "Lekin baribir bizga umuman e'tibor bermayapti." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SPIRAL_OF_RATS_004__M__1
TT 8652 "Qandaydir sababi bo'lishi SHART..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SPIRAL_OF_RATS_006__M__1
TT 8653 "Yaxshi, chunki bizga o'sha vaqtdagi xotiralaring kerak bo'ladi.." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_STAIRS_002__M__1
TT 8654 "E... Tayyor..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_STRAW_RUSH_1_002__M__1
TT 8655 "Xato qilib qo'yma!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_STRAW_RUSH_2_003__M__1
TT 8656 "Ko'rinishidan ular o'tishimizni xohlamayotganga o'xshaydi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_SUDDEN_RATS_002__M__1
TT 8657 "Lekin... Artur uning hali ham tirikligini aytgandi, shundaymi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_THAT_DOOR_002__M__1
TT 8658 "Bilaman... Lekin... ukangni o'yla. Biz davom etishimiz kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_THAT_DOOR_004__M__1
TT 8659 "Oh, Xudoyim... Bu haqiqatmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_THE_ALLEY_001__M__1
TT 8660 "Anavi... Anavi yerdagi jasadmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_THE_ALLEY_003__M__1
TT 8661 "Amisiya, biz to'xtashimiz mumkin. Boshqa yo'l top..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_THE_ALLEY_005__M__1
TT 8662 "Hoy! Seni endi ko'ra olmayapman! Qayt!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_TOO_FAR_1_001__M__1
TT 8663 "Juda uzoqqa ketyapsan! Ehtiyot bo'l!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_TOO_FAR_2_001__M__1
TT 8664 "Yo'q, u yerda hech narsa yo'q!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_TOO_FAR_3_001__M__1
TT 8665 "O'ngga, qani!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_TORCH_001__M__1
TT 8666 "Amisiya, biz davom etishimiz mumkin, lekin sen mash'alani olishing kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_TORCH_REMINDER__M__1
TT 8667 "Bular distillyatorlar emas! Boshqa taxmon!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__CHATTER_WRONG_PLACE__M__1
TT 8668 "Zanjir, Amisiya! O'tib olay!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__HELPER_LUCASS_TURN_REMINDER__M__1
TT 8669 "Xo'sh, matserat oldingmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__HELPER_NEED_BRASERO_000__M__1
TT 8670 "Xonani to'liq aylanib chiqadigan yo'lakni ko'rdim. O'rtadagi mash'ala uni nazorat qilsa kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__HELPER_NEED_BRASERO_002__M__1
TT 8671 "Kalamushlar, Amisiya... Agar sen ularni yorug'likning narigi tomonida to'sib qo'ysang, biz bemalol davom etardik." VO__LUCAS__CH9__HELPER_PUZZLE_BATHS_002__M__1
TT 8672 "Daraxt tanasi! Ular shu yo'ldan ketgan bo'lishi kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__HELPER_WOODEN_BRIDGE__M__1
TT 8673 "Men... Men buni qildim... va ko'rinishidan... ular bilishadi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DANGEROUS_004__M__1
TT 8674 "Unda marhamat, sizdan keyin." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DANGEROUS_006__M__1
TT 8675 "Ma, bu seniki." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DANGEROUS_006__M__2
TT 8676 "Biz uddaladik..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DANGEROUS_008__M__1
TT 8677 "Rahmat. Hech bo'lmaganda endi aniq bilamiz... Agar eliksir kalamushlar bilan bog'liq bo'lsa... demak Tashuvchi bilan ham aloqasi bor..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DANGEROUS_010__M__1
TT 8678 "Amisiya..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DEAD_FATHER_001__M__1
TT 8679 "AMISIYA!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DEAD_FATHER_002__M__1
TT 8680 "Mash'ala..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DEAD_FATHER_003__M__1
TT 8681 "U... sening otangmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_DEAD_FATHER_004__M__1
TT 8682 "U yerda! Boshqa idishlar ham bor..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_HUGOS_ROOM_002__M__1
TT 8683 "Yo'q bu emas... Bunisi ham... Pfff... Yo'q... Yoki bunisi..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_HUGOS_ROOM_003__M__1
TT 8684 "Yo'q yo'q yo'q! Bu yerda emas!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_HUGOS_ROOM_005__M__1
TT 8685 "Yo'q... Bular oddiy standart damlamalar... Onang ancha murakkabroq eliksir ustida ishlagan bo'lishi kerak! Boshqa narsa, boshqa joy, boshqa xona bo'lishi kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_HUGOS_ROOM_007__M__1
TT 8686 "Opus Magnumni shunchaki qila olmaysan... Uning qayerdadir laboratoriyasi bo'lishi kerak!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_HUGOS_ROOM_009__M__1
TT 8687 "Lavrentiy... U laboratoriyasini begonalarning ko'zidan uzoqroqda qurgan... Demak, onang ham shunday qilgan bo'lishi kerak..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_HUGOS_ROOM_011__M__1
TT 8688 "Topdim! Shunday joy yo'qmidi... u yerga sening borishingni u xohlamaydigan? Bilmadim... U himoya qilgan qandaydir joy..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_HUGOS_ROOM_013__M__1
TT 8689 "Rim xarobalari, ha... Aniq alkimyogarning g'oyasi! Ular aynan qayerda?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_HUGOS_ROOM_015__M__1
TT 8690 "Ilg'or kristallanish... ko'k-yashil qirralar... tiniq modda..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_THE_HAND_002__M__1
TT 8691 "Kahrabo isi... ajoyib..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_THE_HAND_004__M__1
TT 8692 "Hyugo uchun dori... u muvaffaqiyatga erishayotgan edi... lekin uni tugatishga vaqti yetmadi." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_THE_HAND_006__M__1
TT 8693 "Ha! Kitobsiz bu yergacha yetib kelgani aql bovar qilmas narsa!" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_THE_HAND_008__M__1
TT 8694 "Kitob va mening tayyorgarligim bilan, menimcha... menimcha, men buni tugata olaman..." VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_THE_HAND_010__M__1
TT 8695 "Men ham xuddi shunday qilgan bo'lardim, Amisiya... u alkimyogar edi... va bilasan-ku... ona o'z farzandlarini himoya qiladi, shunday emasmi?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_THE_HAND_013__M__2
TT 8696 "Oh yo'q! Hozir emas! ... Bu yerdan qanday chiqib ketamiz?" VO__LUCAS__CH9__RTC_THE_HAND_014__M__1
