TT 8710 "Oh... Barmoqlarimni sezmayapman..." VO__LUCAS__CH12__CHATTER_ENTER_GARDEN__M__1
TT 8711 "Amisiya..." VO__LUCAS__CH12__CHATTER_GARDEN_004__M__1
