TT 8721 "Meli 'ustiga siyib yuborish kerak' deydi deb o'ylayman, lekin buning uchun havo juda sovuq..." VO__LUCAS__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_ALONE_CHEST__M__1
TT 8722 "Uh! Nega bunday qilyapti? Qani!" VO__LUCAS__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_GARDEN_001__M__1
TT 8723 "Oh, iltimos, ochil!" VO__LUCAS__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_GARDEN_002__M__1
