TT 8897 "Ha." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_AFTER_DISTRACT1_002__M__1
TT 8898 "Nima? Biz o'tib oldik, shunday emasmi?" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_AFTER_MESS_002__M__1
TT 8899 "Chap tomonda kamonchi! Yot!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_AFTER_TOWER_001__M__1
TT 8900 "E... Ishonching komilmi?" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_AMICIA_HOSTILE_001__M__1
TT 8901 "Va-au... Yaxshi, nima qilayotganingni bilar ekansan..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_AMICIA_HOSTILE_003__M__1
TT 8902 "Biz o'sha qafasni tushirishimiz kerak!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_BEHIND_BARS_004__M__1
TT 8903 "Yaxshiyamki, ular band..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_BREAKING_CHAINS_001__M__1
TT 8904 "Yordam kerakmi?" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_BREAKING_CHAINS_003__M__1
TT 8905 "Ha, men yomon qizman. Endi xursandmisan? Ketishimiz mumkinmi?" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_CAGE_EVENT_INTERACT_004__M__1
TT 8906 "Lagerning narigi chetida chiqish yo'li bor... Agar sen haqiqatan ham bu palaxmondan qanday foydalanishni bilsang, birinchi bo'lib sening borganing ma'qul!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_CAGE_EVENT_INTERACT_007__M__1
TT 8907 "Xavotir olma... Bu sodir bo'lishi aniq edi." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_CAPTAIN_TALK_008__M__1
TT 8908 "Shunga o'xshaydi..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_CROWD_002__M__1
TT 8909 "Hoy! Ularchi? Shunchaki qo'yib yuborasanmi?" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DECOY_001__M__1
TT 8910 "Ehtiyot bo'l." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT_SENTINEL_001__M__1
TT 8911 "Soqchi. Artur uni harakatlanishga majbur qiladi..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT1_CHOICE_001__M__1
TT 8912 "Yo'q, u shunchaki yo'limizni to'sadi..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT1_CHOICE_1_002__M__1
TT 8913 "Joylashuvi unchalik yaxshi emas ekan..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT1_CHOICE_2_002__M__1
TT 8914 "Chalg'itish. U biz qayerda va nimani ko'rsatishimizni kutyapti. Shuning uchun ko'zingni ochib yur." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT1_CHOICE_003__M__3
TT 8915 "Bu ish beradi! Tayyorlan..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT1_OK_002__M__1
TT 8916 "Menga ergashishga!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT1_OK_004__M__1
TT 8917 "Bo'la qol!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT1_OK_006__M__1
TT 8918 "Biz qamalib qoldik! Ular harakatlanishi kerak..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT2_CHOICE__M__1
TT 8919 "Bu yetarlicha shovqin qilmaydi..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT2_CHOICE_1_002__M__1
TT 8920 "Yo'q, yo'limiz to'silib qoladi!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT2_CHOICE_2_002__M__1
TT 8921 "Juda yaxshi! Ketishga tayyorlan!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT2_Ok_002__M__1
TT 8922 "Yaxshi ish, Artur... Ketdik!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT2_OK_004__M__1
TT 8923 "Biz yo'lni tozalashimiz kerak..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT3_CHOICE__M__1
TT 8924 "Chodir yo'limizda turibdi..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT3_CHOICE_1_002__M__1
TT 8925 "Yo'q... Biz bu yo'ldan borishimiz kerak bo'ladi..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT3_CHOICE_2_002__M__1
TT 8926 "Ha, yaxshi ko'rding!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT3_Ok_002__M__1
TT 8927 "Hozir! Chapga!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_DISTRACT3_OK_004__M__1
TT 8928 "Bu bizning chiqish yo'limiz! Tezroq!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_FOUND_LADDER_002__M__1
TT 8929 "Tinchlan!" VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_HUGO_IN_SIGHT_002__M__1
TT 8930 "Ayni vaqti..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_HUGO_IN_SIGHT_006__M__1
TT 8931 "Sekin..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_HUGO_RELEASED_001__M__1
