TT 8969 "Ular unga hech narsa qilishmaydi." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_YOU_TOO_002__M__1
TT 8970 "Sabrli bo'lishing kerak..." VO__MELIE__CH4__CHATTER_YOU_TOO_004__M__1
