TT 9114 "Qanchadan qancha la'nati kalamushlar..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_THE_OTHER_SIDE_001__M__1
TT 9115 "Mana senga! Albatta! Ularni umuman sog'inganim yo'q edi..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_THE_TRENCH_001__M__1
TT 9116 "Bu aqldan ozish!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_THUNDER_002__M__1
TT 9117 "La'nat! La'nat! Jin ursin!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_THUNDER_3_002__M__1
TT 9118 "Hammalaring yaxshimisizlar?... Yetib keldikmi? Rostdanmi?" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_THUNDER_END_001__M__1
TT 9119 "Ehtiyot bo'l!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TIME_IS_NOW_001__M__1
TT 9120 "Amisiya, senda Devorantis qoldimi?" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TIME_IS_NOW_003__M__1
TT 9121 "Unda qani! Dubulg'asini urib tushir!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TIME_IS_NOW_005__M__1
TT 9122 "Olov!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TIME_IS_NOW_006__M__1
TT 9123 "Yaxshi, tezroq yasab ol!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TIME_IS_NOW_006__M__2
TT 9124 "Qani, vaqti keldi!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TIME_IS_NOW_007__M__1
TT 9125 "Kelyapman! Tepaga chiqishga sabrim chidamayapti..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TOGETHER_AGAIN_001__M__1
TT 9126 "Ularga qara... qirol saroyidagi asilzodalarga o'xshab to'dalanib yurishibdi..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TOGETHER_AGAIN_002__M__1
TT 9127 "O'tib keta olasizmi?" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TOO_LONG_1__M__1
TT 9128 "Hoy! Tezroq yur! Bu tabiat bag'rida sayr emas!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TOO_LONG_2__M__1
TT 9129 "Soqchilar shundoq orqamizda ekanligini eslatishim shartmi?" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TOO_LONG_3__M__1
TT 9130 "Agar Inkvizitsiya yetib kelsa, mendan yordam so'rama!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TOO_LONG_4__M__1
TT 9131 "Tinchlan..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TOO_MANY_GUARDS_002__M__1
TT 9132 "Eshit. Amisiya, senda palaxmon bor, shuning uchun sen birinchi borasan. Hyugo, sen... e... Atrofni kuzatib bor. Va jim tur." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_TOO_MANY_GUARDS_004__M__1
TT 9133 "Yaxshi. Yur!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_UNDER_THE_DOME_001__M__1
TT 9134 "Yaxshi ko'rding!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_UNLOCKED_WINDOW_001__M__1
TT 9135 "Senga narvon kerak bo'ladi!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_UP_AGAIN_001__M__1
TT 9136 "Bilmadim, Amazonka Amisiya, ularga ertak aytib ber!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_UP_AGAIN_002__M__2
TT 9137 "Hali emas, hali emas, hali emas..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WAITING_THUNDER_001__M__1
TT 9138 "Ha, biz o'tish uchun undan foydalanamiz." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WATERMILL_002__M__1
TT 9139 "U doim... shundaymi?" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WATERMILL_004__M__1
TT 9140 "Ha... Buni boshlash uchun eng zo'r vaqt emas..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WATERMILL_006__M__1
TT 9141 "I'll do it." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WATERMILL_008__M__1
TT 9142 "Agar inkvizitsiya shu yergacha yetib kelsa, bu ularni biroz ushlab turadi." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WATERMILL_OK_003__M__1
TT 9143 "Oqim juda kuchli..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WAY_TO_CROSS_001__M__1
TT 9144 "Uni to'xtatish orqali..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WAY_TO_CROSS_003__M__1
TT 9145 "Amisiya..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WAY_TO_CROSS_005__M__1
TT 9146 "Oooh..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WEIRD_NOISE_001__M__1
TT 9147 "Hech narsa, shunchaki... Eski abjag'i chiqqan richag..." VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WEIRD_NOISE_003__M__1
TT 9148 "Hammasi yaxshi bo'ladi! Bu sening qal'ang! Sening 'aloqang' bor!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WEIRD_NOISE_005__M__1
TT 9149 "Oh, bilasanmi, men ko'proq yerto'la qiziman!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WEIRD_NOISE_007__M__1
TT 9150 "Endi faqat narigi tomonga o'tishimiz kerak xolos!" VO__MELIE__CH5__CHATTER_WHEEL_STOPPED_003__M__1
TT 9151 "Uni pastga tushira olamiz deb o'ylaysanmi?" VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_BRIDGE_001__M__1
TT 9152 "Oldin o'sha g'ildirakni to'xtatishimiz kerak... yo'qsa, buning oxiri baxayr bo'lmaydi." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_CANT_GO_001__M__1
TT 9153 "G'ildirak aylanayotganda emas... Juda xavfli." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_CANT_GO_002__M__1
TT 9154 "Qarshimizdagi chuqurlik. Muammo shu yerda." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_CAVITY_001__M__1
TT 9155 "Qani! Men sen bilanman!" VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_FIRST_TORCH_001__M__1
TT 9156 "Xa! Har doimgidek o'tkir!" VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_LIGHT_NEEDED_003__M__1
TT 9157 "Boshqa tomondan senga yordam bera olaman Amisiya, lekin o'tishim uchun g'ildirak barqaror bo'lishi kerak." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_MELIE_CROSS_NEEDS_001__M__1
TT 9158 "Amisiya, menga o'tishga yordam ber va men boshqa tomondan senga yordamlashaman." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_MELIE_CROSS_NEEDS_002__M__1
TT 9159 "Amisiya, xomxayollar og'ushida yurishni bas qil! Menga gulxanni qaytarib yuborishing kerak!" VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_NEED_BRASERO_BACK_001__M__1
TT 9160 "Biz qulfni to'liq yopishimiz kerak... G'ildirakdagi tormoz qolganini o'zi qiladi." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_NEEDS_BOTH_001__M__1
TT 9161 "Agar biz oqimni to'xtata olsak, g'ildirak ham to'xtashi kerak." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_NEEDS_BOTH_002__M__1
TT 9162 "Gulxan. Uni jildirishing mumkin." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_NO_FIRE_001__M__1
TT 9163 "Hoy! Orqangda o't yoqadigan shox-shabba bor!" VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_TRUE_FRIEND_001__M__1
TT 9164 "Yo'q... Balki boshqa tomondan..." VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_WRONG_SIDE_002__M__1
TT 9165 "Yaxshi, eshikni men hal qilaman!" VO__MELIE__CH5__HELPER_WRONG_SIDE_003__M__1
TT 9166 "Bu yashirinadigan joy, bolakay. Lordlar va xonimlar bilan ziyofat qilish uchun emas, yashirinish uchun mo'ljallangan. Unga teginma! Bu akamniki. Bu juda qimmat turadi, o'sha." VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_HIDE_MELIE_002__M__1
TT 9167 "Bezori va tilanchilarga o'xshabmi demoqchisan? Oilaviy an'ana... Otamiz bir axlat bo'lgan. Bizni bir marta ko'proq do'pposlashga urindi, biz esa qochib ketdik. Lekin sen, sen deyarli qirol oilasidansan." VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_HIDE_MELIE_004__M__1
TT 9168 "'Xa' nima degani?" VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_HIDE_MELIE_006__M__1
TT 9169 "Nima demoqchisan? Unda bizga kim to'laydi??" VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_HIDE_MELIE_009__M__1
TT 9170 "O'rtog'ing Lukas sizni boy dedi!" VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_HIDE_MELIE_011__M__1
TT 9171 "Shunchaki buni unut, xo'pmi? Arturning to'shagini ol... u yetib kelganda, biz jiddiy gaplashib olamiz." VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_HIDE_MELIE_013__M__1
TT 9172 "Shsh..." VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_HIDE_MELIE_014__M__1
TT 9173 "Biz uddaladik! Ularni orqaga qaytardik!" VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_SAFE_AGAIN_001__M__1
TT 9174 "G'alabamizni nishonlash uchun... iltimos, yomg'irdan panasiga o'tsak maylimi?" VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_SAFE_AGAIN_008__M__1
TT 9175 "Hozir yashirinishimiz kerak. Artur ikkimiz bir joyni bilamiz." VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_TRANSITION_002__M__1
TT 9176 "U sening qal'angda kutyapti... Hammasi o'z vaqti-soati bilan." VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_TRANSITION_004__M__1
TT 9177 "Biz to'g'ri yo'ldamiz. Harakatda davom etaylik. Biz hali xavfsiz emasmiz." VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_TRANSITION_009__M__1
TT 9178 "VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_TRANSITION_ONOM_003__M__1" VO__MELIE__CH5__RTC_TRANSITION_ONOM_003__M__1
TT 9179 "Qani... Gaplashib olishimiz kerak." VO__MELIE__CH6__CHATTER_WALK_WITH_MELIE_001__M__1
TT 9180 "Bu qal'a vayrona..." VO__MELIE__CH6__CHATTER_WALK_WITH_MELIE_003__M__1
TT 9181 "Senga aynan shu kerak." VO__MELIE__CH6__CHATTER_WALK_WITH_MELIE_005__M__1
TT 9182 "Bu joyni qurgan odam unga umuman tegishlarini xohlamagan. Oqil bo'l va shunda yaxshi bo'lasan." VO__MELIE__CH6__CHATTER_WALK_WITH_MELIE_006__M__1
TT 9183 "U mening muammom. Sen ham men eshitgan narsani eshitding... O'sha Inkvizitsiya itlari uni Bastionga olib ketishdi. Qayerdan qidirishni bilaman. Uni topaman." VO__MELIE__CH6__CHATTER_WALK_WITH_MELIE_008__M__1
TT 9184 "Eshit... Hyugo bilan... bu oson ko'rinmayapti, lekin ishonaver, bu shunga arziydi... U seni qutqaradi. Ular har doim oxirida bizni qutqarishadi... Hatto, bilasanmi... akalar, ukalar... ba'zida ularni shunchaki o'ldirging keladi." VO__MELIE__CH6__CHATTER_WALK_WITH_MELIE_010__M__1
TT 9185 "Xuddi bu mening uslubimdek..." VO__MELIE__CH6__CHATTER_WALK_WITH_MELIE_013__M__1
TT 9186 "Vaqtni chog' o'tkazyapsanmi? Inkvizitsiya ham shunday qilyapti degan umiddaman." VO__MELIE__CH6__CHATTER_WALLS_MELIE_003__M__1
TT 9187 "Nihoyat... Yaxshi, ketdik!" VO__MELIE__CH6__RTC_DEPARTURE_001__M__1
TT 9188 "Men o'sha joyni bilaman, u shaharda, ukamni saqlashayotgan joydan unchalik uzoq emas. Agar shunday xavfni o'z bo'yninga olishga tayyor bo'lsang... u yerga kirishga yordam bera olaman." VO__MELIE__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_014__M__1
TT 9189 "Yaxshi. Narsalarimni yig'ib olaman. Qachon ketishni xohlasang, men bilan ichkarida uchrashasan!" VO__MELIE__CH6__RTC_FAMILY_016__M__1
TT 9190 "Ziyofatga ketyapsanmi yoki nimadir?" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_FLOWER_INTERACT_001__M__1
TT 9191 "Aristokratlar..." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_FLOWER_INTERACT_003__M__1
TT 9192 "Yo'q..." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_HORSE_COLLAR_000__M__1
TT 9193 "O'g'ri... Men u bilan ishlaganman... Unda iqtidor bor edi." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_HORSE_COLLAR_002__M__1
TT 9194 "Men Arturni bunday bo'yinbog' bilan ko'rishni xohlamayman." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_HORSE_COLLAR_004__M__1
TT 9195 "Hoy! Kutyapman!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_HORSE_COLLAR_WAIT_001__M__1
TT 9196 "Nima qilyapsan? Yur!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_HORSE_COLLAR_WAIT_002__M__1
TT 9197 "Qani! Kun bo'yi vaqtimiz yo'q!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_HORSE_COLLAR_WAIT_003__M__1
TT 9198 "Men buni ochaman, keyin borib Artur bilan shug'ullanaman." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_LOCKPICKING_001__M__1
TT 9199 "Bu narigi chetdagi katta bino. Adashib qolishing mumkin emas." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_LOCKPICKING_003__M__1
TT 9200 "Umid qilamanki... mendan qarzdorsan." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_LOCKPICKING_005__M__1
TT 9201 "Jin ursin..." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_LOCKPICKING_006__M__1
TT 9202 "Bu senga o'lish taqiqlanganini anglatadi." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_LOCKPICKING_007__M__1
TT 9203 "Ana, marhamat!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_LOCKPICKING_009__M__1
TT 9204 "Yur! Qani, harakat qil!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_LOCKPICKING_010__M__1
TT 9205 "Bu shahar aholisi. Ular evakuatsiya qilinyapti..." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_OUT_OF_THE_WOODS_001__M__1
TT 9206 "Aynan. Tishlash bo'lgan joyda esa, sen yana topishing mumkin..." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_OUT_OF_THE_WOODS_003__M__1
TT 9207 "Rosa aqllisan-a!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_OUT_OF_THE_WOODS_005__M__1
TT 9208 "Omad!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_SAY_GOODBYE_001__M__1
TT 9209 "Amisiya... Tuni bo'yi vaqtimiz yo'q..." VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_WAIT_GOODBYE_001__M__1
TT 9210 "Soqchilar qaytib kelishini kutyapsanmi, yoki nima? Yo'qol bu yerdan!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_WAIT_GOODBYE_002__M__1
TT 9211 "Amisiya, yur! O'sha tomonga!" VO__MELIE__CH7__CHATTER_WAIT_GOODBYE_003__M__1
TT 9212 "...Tirik qolishning birinchi qoidasi oyoqlari orasiga tepish." VO__MELIE__CH7__RTC_TRANSITION_001__M__1
TT 9213 "Sen juda yumshoqsan... Shsh... Anavi shahar devorlari!" VO__MELIE__CH7__RTC_TRANSITION_003__M__1
TT 9214 "Amisiya, biz... Biz keldik chunki... Xo'sh... Artur, sen ayt unga..." VO__MELIE__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_013__M__1
TT 9215 "Bu oson bo'lmadi, ishonaver..." VO__MELIE__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_017__M__1
TT 9216 "Sen boraver. Biz u bilan shu yerda qolamiz." VO__MELIE__CH8__RTC_EPISANGUIS_CURE_027__M__1
TT 9217 "Amisiya! Amisiya! Ishonmaysan - Rodrik palaxmonda Arturni YENGDI!" VO__MELIE__CH10__RTC_CURE_COMPLETE_019__M__1
TT 9218 "Men unga aytaveraman..." VO__MELIE__CH10__RTC_CURE_COMPLETE_022__M__1
TT 9219 "Hyugo!" VO__MELIE__CH10__RTC_CURE_COMPLETE_028__M__1
TT 9220 "U uyg'ondi!" VO__MELIE__CH11__RTC_WAKE_UP_013__M__1
TT 9221 "Artur ikkimiz sizlarni qidirib topdik, lekin..." VO__MELIE__CH11__RTC_WAKE_UP_016__M__1
TT 9222 "Sandiqni ichkariga kiritish kerak deb o'ylamaysanmi?" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_BACK_TO_LUCAS_001__M__1
TT 9223 "Barmoqlarimchi? Ularga nima yaxshi bo'lishi mumkin?" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_BACK_TO_LUCAS_003__M__1
TT 9224 "Biz ularni to'sib qo'yishimiz kerak!" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_GARDEN_001__M__1
TT 9225 "U qimir etmayapti!" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_GARDEN_009__M__1
TT 9226 "U qayerga olib boradi?" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_HALLWAY_001__M__1
TT 9227 "Hammasi joyida. U har doim bizni ushlab olishadi deb o'ylaydi... U juda ko'p xavotir oladi. O'zing-chi? Yaxshimisan?" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_002__M__1
TT 9228 "Shoshilma, xo'pmi?" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_004__M__1
TT 9229 "E, yo'q... Artur shunchaki ketmoqchiligini aytyapti... yana..." VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_ARTHUR_002__M__1
TT 9230 "Boraver... Uni g'azablantirmaslikka harakat qil..." VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_ARTHUR_005__M__1
TT 9231 "Chunki sen bezorsan, ana shuning uchun." VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_INTERACT_MELIE_ARTHUR_007__M__1
TT 9232 "Men Lukasning oldiga boraman. Bechoraning hal qiladigan kichik muammosi bor ekan." VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_CHEST_NO_002__M__1
TT 9233 "Ha, albatta! U shunchaki meni ko'rmoqchi bo'lyapti, xolos!" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_CHEST_YES_002__M__1
TT 9234 "Ha ha ha!" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_MELIE_002__M__1
TT 9235 "Xa xa xa! Sigirni itarayotganingni tasavvur qilyapman!" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_LUCAS_MELIE_004__M__1
TT 9236 "Va men shu yerda qolishni xohlayman!" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_MELIE_AND_ARTHUR_001__M__1
TT 9237 "'Nima bo'lardi, nima bo'lardi'. Hayvonga o'xshab yashashni bas qilsang nima bo'lardi?" VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_MELIE_AND_ARTHUR_003__M__1
TT 9238 "Hoy..." VO__MELIE__CH12__CHATTER_MELIE_AND_ARTHUR_005__M__1
TT 9239 "Yo'q! Nima balo bo'lyapti o'zi? Artur, seni tishlab olishdimi?" VO__MELIE__CH12__RTC_CORRUPTED_BROTHER_004__M__1
TT 9240 "Ular... juda... ko'p..." VO__MELIE__CH12__RTC_INVASION_004__M__1
TT 9241 "Artur!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_KING_OF_THE_RATS_017__M__1
TT 9242 "Artur?? Yo'q yo'q yo'q!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_002__M__1
TT 9243 "ARTUR!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_003__M__1
TT 9244 "Men ularni o'ldiraman! Ularni parchalab tashlayman!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_005__M__1
TT 9245 "Shunchaki og'zingni yop, xo'pmi?" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_007__M__1
TT 9246 "Hammalarini o'ldiraman!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_009__M__1
TT 9247 "Ularning la'nati bayrog'ini yoqib yuboraman!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_009__M__2
TT 9248 "O'zing-chi?" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_011__M__1
TT 9249 "Shunchaki shu yerda turaverasanmi?" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_011__M__2
TT 9250 "Shunchaki uyg'on! Qara!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_012__M__1
TT 9251 "Bilamanki, biz hammamiz birma-bir o'lyapmiz!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_014__M__1
TT 9252 "Ular akamni olishdi..." VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_014__M__2
TT 9253 "Sening otangni! Senikini!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_014__M__3
TT 9254 "Hech narsa qolmadi... HECH NARSA!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_015__M__1
TT 9255 "Shuning uchun, ketdik." VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_026__M__1
TT 9256 "O'limgacha!" VO__MELIE__CH13__RTC_THE_CALL_030__M__1
TT 9257 "Ha! Kalamushlar yegandan keyin unchalik mag'rur ko'rinmayapsan, a?" VO__MELIE__CH14__CHATTER_AFTER_FIGHT_1_001__M__1
