TT 9260 "Jin ursin... Bu qonli tartibsizlik..." VO__MELIE__CH14__CHATTER_BEFORE_FIGHT_002__M__1
TT 9261 "Hoy! Bu yoqqa!" VO__MELIE__CH14__CHATTER_CALLING_AFAR_002__M__1
TT 9262 "Salom senga!" VO__MELIE__CH14__CHATTER_CALLING_AFAR_LOOP_002__M__1
