TT 9563 "Bu oxiri!" VO__NICHOLAS__CH13__CHATTER_ORPHANS_THIRD_FOUND__M__3
TT 9564 "Oh... Bu og'riqsiz bo'lmasligi aniq..." VO__NICHOLAS__CH13__CHATTER_ORPHANS_THIRD_FOUND__M__4
TT 9565 "U o'yinchoq bilan nima qilmoqchisan o'zi?" VO__NICHOLAS__CH13__CHATTER_USELESS_SLING__M__1
TT 9566 "Amisiya, qani..." VO__NICHOLAS__CH13__CHATTER_USELESS_SLING__M__2
TT 9567 "Juda ta'sirli!... Endi mening navbatim..." VO__NICHOLAS__CH13__CHATTER_USELESS_SLING_003__M__1
