TT 9608 "Yaxshi. Hushyor bo'lib turinglar." VO__NICHOLAS__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__2
TT 9609 "Bu olma daraxti sen tug'ilganingda ekilgan... U sening qadringni isbotlaydi!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_APPLE_TREE_001__M__1
TT 9610 "Muqaddas... e... Muqaddas Olma Daraxtining muqaddas olmalari Buyuk Yovuzlik tomonidan zararlangan! Agar men o'ngacha sanagunimcha bu chirigan olmalardan oltitasini yo'q qila olsang... Seni Ritsar qilaman." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_APPLE_TREE_003__M__1
TT 9611 "Anavi yerdagi daraxt tanasi yonida toshlarni ko'ryapman. Borib ularni ol, va tayyor bo'lganingda ayt." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_APPLE_TREE_005__M__1
TT 9612 "Yomon emas!... Lekin palaxmoning daxshatli shovqin chiqarar ekan..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_CHALLENGE_AVERAGE_001__M__1
TT 9613 "Oho... Aytishim kerakki, qoyil qoldim!... Lekin palaxmoning daxshatli darajada shovqin qilar ekan..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_CHALLENGE_AVERAGE_002__M__1
TT 9614 "Oh ha... Butunlay yodimdan ko'tarilibdi." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_CHALLENGE_AVERAGE_004__M__1
TT 9615 "Amisiya! U nimadir topdimi?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_DOG_HUNT_002__M__1
TT 9616 "Xudoyim... Unga nima bo'ldi?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_DOG_LEAVES_001__M__1
TT 9617 "Sen boraver! Men senga yetib olaman. Sen mendan ko'ra ancha tezsan..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_DOG_LEAVES_003__M__1
TT 9618 "Yaxshi, ketdik!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_FATHER_WALK_000__M__1
TT 9619 "Ehtiyot bo'l! Boshini nishonga olishing kerak!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_HOG_HEAD_001__M__1
TT 9620 "Bilaman. Buni eplay olasan, azizam..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_HOG_HEAD_003__M__1
TT 9621 "Bildirmasdan yaqinlashishning yo'lini top! Boshiga urishing kerak!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_HOG_LEAVES_002__M__1
TT 9622 "Yur, Amisiya. Endi, yana urinib ko'r!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_HOG_LEAVES_004__M__1
TT 9623 "Ha! Sening hayvoning har doimgidek qorni bilan o'ylaydi..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_LION_ON_FIRE_001__M__1
TT 9624 "Xmm, bu qattiq tegadigan bo'ldi..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_LION_ON_FIRE_003__M__1
TT 9625 "Oho..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_LION_ON_FIRE_004__M__1
TT 9626 "Uzoqqa ketib qolma... Davom etamiz!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_LION_ON_FIRE_006__M__1
TT 9627 "Qara... Onangning lentasi hali ham shu yerda! Bilasanmi, men unga aynan shu yerda ko'ngil qo'yganman..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_MOTHERS_HEADBAND_001__M__1
TT 9628 "Hammamizning majburiyatlarimiz bor, Amisiya. Sen..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_MOTHERS_HEADBAND_003__M__1
TT 9629 "Bilasanmi, oilada..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_MOTHERS_HEADBAND_004__M__1
TT 9630 "Hoy! Men unga bir narsa demoqchiman!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_MOTHERS_HEADBAND_005__M__1
TT 9631 "Bor! Va biron marta nimadir olib kel!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_MOTHERS_HEADBAND_007__M__1
TT 9632 "To'g'ri. Aytayotganimdek... Hammamizning majburiyatlarimiz bor. Men bu yerlarni boshqarishim kerak, onang ukang bilan shug'ullanishi kerak, va sen..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_MOTHERS_HEADBAND_008__M__1
TT 9633 "Eshit... Biz hozir sen uchun bu yerdamiz, shuning uchun..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_MOTHERS_HEADBAND_010__M__1
TT 9634 "Yaxshi zarba!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_NICE_SHOT__M__1
TT 9635 "Bu sayr haqida ancha vaqtdan beri gapirarding... Nega aynan bu yer?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_RED_AMICIA_001__M__1
TT 9636 "Qaysi daraxt?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_RED_AMICIA_003__M__1
TT 9637 "Ritsar chaqirig'i... Lekin bilasan-ku, sen endi o'n yoshli bola emassan..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_RED_AMICIA_005__M__1
TT 9638 "Yaxshi, orqaga qayt! Shu daraxt tanasining orqasida tur! Shu yerdan otasan!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_SHOOTING_POSITION_001__M__1
TT 9639 "Ajoyib o'lja... Kichik bazm uchun ayni muddao..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_SPOTTING_HOG_002__M__1
TT 9640 "Bu ish berishi mumkin... lekin yaqinroq borishing kerak bo'ladi... Agar pastroq yursang, bu o'tlar seni yashirib qoladi..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_SPOTTING_HOG_004__M__1
TT 9641 "Amisiya, men daraxt tanasining orqasida dedim! Qoidalarga rioya qil!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_STEP_BACK__M__1
TT 9642 "Hatto o'yinda ham o'z mas'uliyatlaringni unutishga ulgurasan..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_STEP_BACK__M__2
TT 9643 "Uzun o'tlardan foydalan! Pastda yur!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TALL_GRASS_001__M__1
TT 9644 "Mening ortimdan yur, qizim!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TO_THE_APPLE_TREE_001__M__1
TT 9645 "Umid qilamanki, palahmoning o'zing bilan!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TO_THE_APPLE_TREE_003__M__1
TT 9646 "Qani, ketdik!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TO_THE_APPLE_TREE_005__M__1
TT 9647 "Sinov darvozasiga kirishga jur'ating yetadimi?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TO_THE_APPLE_TREE_005__M__2
TT 9648 "Qani, boshladik!..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_001__M__1
TT 9649 "Bir..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_002__M__1
TT 9650 "Ikki..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_003__M__1
TT 9651 "Uch..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_004__M__1
TT 9652 "To'rt..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_006__M__1
TT 9653 "Besh..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_008__M__1
TT 9654 "Olti..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_010__M__1
TT 9655 "Yetti..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_011__M__1
TT 9656 "Sakkiz..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_012__M__1
TT 9657 "To'qqiz..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_013__M__1
TT 9658 "Va... o'n!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_014__M__1
TT 9659 "Tezroq Amisiya!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_TRIAL_015__M__1
TT 9660 "Amisiya... Nima qilyapsan?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_WANDERING_AROUND_001__M__1
TT 9661 "Bu olmalar o'z-o'zidan to'kiladi deb o'ylamayman..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_WANDERING_AROUND_002__M__1
TT 9662 "Bu sinovni o'zing so'rading, Amisiya... Kutayapman..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__CHATTER_WANDERING_AROUND_003__M__1
TT 9663 "Qani, Amisiya! Kutayapman!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__HELPER_MOTHER_RIBBON_000__M__1
TT 9664 "Imillayapsan, Amisiya!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_HORSE_RUN_001__M__1
TT 9665 "Qanday qilib lordlar bilan ovga chiqa olasan?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_HORSE_RUN_001__M__2
TT 9666 "Aziz qizim, qachondir turmushga chiqishing kerak..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_HORSE_RUN_003__M__1
TT 9667 "Unda De Runlar avlodini qanday davom ettirmoqchisan?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_HORSE_RUN_005__M__1
TT 9668 "Onasining qizi..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_HORSE_RUN_007__M__1
TT 9669 "Ishonchli qo'llarda." VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_HUGO_015__M__1
TT 9670 "Bu qanday yovuzlik?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_SOMETHING_IN_THE_GROUND_003__M__1
TT 9671 "Ketishimiz kerak... Zudlik bilan!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_SOMETHING_IN_THE_GROUND_004__M__1
TT 9672 "Ov tashkil qilaman. Borib onangni top - unga gapim borligini ayt. U ehtimol..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_SOMETHING_IN_THE_GROUND_005__M__1
TT 9673 "Amisiya..." VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_SOMETHING_IN_THE_GROUND_007__M__1
TT 9674 "Yaxshi it edi." VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_SOMETHING_IN_THE_GROUND_008__M__1
TT 9675 "Ochlik har doim seni shunday mergan qiladimi?" VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_WINNER_001__M__1
TT 9676 "Lekin ziyofat hali tarelkalaringga yetib kelmadi!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_WINNER_003__M__1
TT 9677 "Bunga shubham yo'q!" VO__ROBERT__CH1__RTC_WINNER_007__M__1
TT 9678 "VO__ROBERT__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_INTERACT__M__1" VO__ROBERT__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_INTERACT__M__1
