TT 9682 "Bu sening aybing emas. Kitobing haqida o'yla." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_ABOUT_FIRE_002__M__1
TT 9683 "Bu la'nati kitobning nimasi bunchalik o'zgacha?" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BOOK_002__M__1
TT 9684 "Uning qayerdaligini bilmayman! Faqat shuni bilamanki, ular otamni shu kitob uchun qiynoqqa solib o'ldirishdi va men ularni o'ldiraman." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BOOK_004__M__1
TT 9685 "Bu yerdan birga chiqib ketishimiz mumkin." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BOOK_006__M__1
TT 9686 "Hali ko'rasan... Bu yerda ular juda ko'p..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BOOK_008__M__1
TT 9687 "Kimligingni bilmayman, lekin rahmat..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_AMICIA_ATTACKS_003__M__1
TT 9688 "Maxsus buyurtma... Otamning shoh asari..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_AMICIA_ATTACKS_005__M__1
TT 9689 "Bunga biroz vaqt ketadi!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_AMICIA_ATTACKS_006__M__3
TT 9690 "Qiziq." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_BOOKCASE_001__M__1
TT 9691 "Bu kitobga olib boradigan yo'ling... Oson!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_BOOKCASE_003__M__1
TT 9692 "Balki shoshilgandirman... Men qarshi og'irlik vazifasini bajarishim kerak... Men shu yerda qolaman. Qaysi dastakni tortishimni ayt." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_BOOKCASE_004__M__1
TT 9693 "Qani, qani tezroq!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_BURNING_GUARD_002__M__1
TT 9694 "Ular haqida qayg'urma!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_BURNING_GUARD_003__M__1
TT 9695 "Qoch, Amisiya, yo'lni to'syapsan!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CANT_LEVER__M__1
TT 9696 "Qochishing kerak, Amisiya!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CANT_LEVER__M__2
TT 9697 "Unda ustidan tush!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CANT_LEVER__M__3
TT 9698 "Qulflangan! Orqasi yonyapti! Uzoqroq tur!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CLOSED_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 9699 "Men... ochyapman... uni!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CLOSED_DOOR_003__M__1
TT 9700 "Qizig'i yo'q!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CLOSED_DOOR_005__M__1
TT 9701 "Ha! Buni sendan eshitish g'alati!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CONVOY_RODRIC_002__M__1
TT 9702 "Oh, zo'r aytildi..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CONVOY_RODRIC_007__M__1
TT 9703 "Kuta olmayman..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CONVOY_RODRIC_009__M__1
TT 9704 "Tez orada bilib olamiz..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CORDS_002__M__1
TT 9705 "Men qildim! Ochildi!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CRASH_002__M__1
TT 9706 "Xo'sh, agar bu sevgi bo'lmasa, unda nimaligini bilmayman..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_CRATE_OK_002__M__1
TT 9707 "Ha! Jin ursin!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_DOOR_OPENED_FIRE_001__M__1
TT 9708 "Yugur! Yana ozgina qoldi!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_DOOR_OPENED_FIRE_004__M__1
TT 9709 "Otam haqida gapirma..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_DOOR_ROOM_002__M__1
TT 9710 "Polni rasvo qilding..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_DOOR_WORK_002__M__1
TT 9711 "Bu mozaika uchun haftalab vaqt sarflagandik..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_DOOR_WORK_004__M__1
TT 9712 "Seni o'ldiraman, bilib qo'y... Bu eshikni qanday ochishni eslashim bilan." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_DOOR_WORK_006__M__1
TT 9713 "Ortimdan yur! Va kitobingga ehtiyot bo'l!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_ENTER_HALL_002__M__1
TT 9714 "Ha. Chuqur nafas ol." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_ENTER_THE_FIRE_002__M__1
TT 9715 "Faqat olovni nishonga olish kerak..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_EXTINGUISH_CRAFTED__M__1
TT 9716 "Aynan ular uchun..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_EXTINGUISH_OK_002__M__1
TT 9717 "Bu yaxshi. Bundan unumli foydalanishimiz kerak..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_FIRE_004__M__1
TT 9718 "Barakalla! Bu Inkvizitsiyaga xos o'lim..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_GUARD_PATROL_DEAD__M__1
TT 9719 "O'ylama! Yugur!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_GUARDS_CHASE_003__M__1
TT 9720 "Ikki kundan beri... shuni qilishni... xohlayotgandim!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_KICKING__M__1
TT 9721 "Qanday daxshat!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_KICKING_BARRIER_002__M__1
TT 9722 "Yo'q, ularni sekinlashtirishimiz kerak..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_LOCK_DOOR_002__M__1
TT 9723 "Majburmiz!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_LOCK_DOOR_004__M__1
TT 9724 "Anavi yerdagi quti! Undan tirgak sifatida foydalanishing mumkin!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_NEED_CRATE_001__M__1
TT 9725 "Ikkita soqchi. Bittasini yo'ldan olib tashlashimiz kerak..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_NEEDS_DISTRACT__M__1
TT 9726 "Amisiya, dubulg'alar..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_NEEDS_DISTRACT_HELPER__M__1
TT 9727 "Mutlaqo qo'shilaman!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_OPEN_DOOR_002__M__1
TT 9728 "Tashqariga olib boradi." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_OPEN_DOOR_004__M__1
TT 9729 "Olov... isini sezyapman..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_OUTSIDE_002__M__1
TT 9730 "Darhol!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_PULL_LEVER__M__1
TT 9731 "Yey!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_PULL_LEVER__M__2
TT 9732 "Qani, boshladik!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_PULL_LEVER__M__3
TT 9733 "Hoy! O'zingni jarohatlama! Xohlasang, men..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_PUSHING_THE_CRATE_002__M__1
TT 9734 "Ha, singan qo'l bilan kitobni qaytarib olib kelishing qiyin bo'ladi..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_PUSHING_THE_CRATE_004__M__1
TT 9735 "Taqqiqlangan kitoblar... Shu sababli bu eshikni qurganmiz." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_PUZZLE_ROOM_002__M__1
TT 9736 "Ana..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_PUZZLE_ROOM_004__M__1
TT 9737 "Qara, tepada..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_RED_BOOK_001__M__1
TT 9738 "Oh... jin ursin..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_RODRIC_AHEAD__M__1
TT 9739 "Ikkita... Har birimizga bittadan, kelishdikmi? Men dubulg'alisini olaman." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_RODRIC_DOUBLE_KILL_001__M__1
TT 9740 "Bu faqat vaqt masalasi. Qachon tayyor bo'lsang." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_RODRIC_DOUBLE_KILL_003__M__1
TT 9741 "Mukammal." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_RODRIC_DOUBLE_KILL_OK__M__1
TT 9742 "Ko'p narsani bilasan, Amisiya..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_RODRICS_FATHER_002__M__1
TT 9743 "Bir turdagi... rohiblar. Ular ko'p gapirishmasdi. Otam uni loyihalashtirgan, u usta edi. Men esa shunchaki shogird edim." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_RODRICS_FATHER_006__M__1
TT 9744 "Ularni ancha g'azablantirdik..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_RUNNING_GUARDS_CORRIDOR_004__M__1
TT 9745 "Bir-biringizni yaxshi taniydigan ko'rinasizlar..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_SECRET_DOOR_001__M__1
TT 9746 "Buning nimaligini bilaman!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_SECRET_DOOR_003__M__1
TT 9747 "Tayyormisan? U yerda haqiqiy do'zax bo'ladi." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_SECRET_DOOR_004__M__1
TT 9748 "To'g'ri bajaraman, xavotir olma..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_SENT_RODRIC_002__M__1
TT 9749 "Jin ursin! Chapga!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_SHELF_EXPLOSION_001__M__1
TT 9750 "Yaxshi..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_STAY_CLOSE_002__M__1
TT 9751 "Keldik hisob..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_THE_PATH_002__M__1
TT 9752 "Qani, qani... Ana xolos! Tezroq!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_THE_PATH_008__M__1
TT 9753 "Yagona yo'l shu." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_TOWARDS_FIRE_002__M__1
TT 9754 "Lekin u kelayotganimni ko'rib qoladi." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_TUTO_RODRIC_DISTRACT_002__M__1
TT 9755 "To'xta... Meni so'roq qilish uchun Bastionga olib ketishganda, alkimyogarlar Exstinguis deb ataladigan bir narsa yasayotganini ko'rdim. U olovni o'chiradi. Men uni keyinroqqa olib qo'ymoqchi edim, lekin..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_TUTO_RODRIC_EXTINGUISH_002__M__1
TT 9756 "U boshqa tomonga qarayapti. Men uni eplayman." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_TUTO_RODRIC_KILL_002__M__1
TT 9757 "Bajonidil... Qachon tayyor bo'lsang." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_TUTO_RODRIC_KILL_004__M__1
TT 9758 "Bu otam uchun..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_TUTO_RODRIC_KILL_005__M__1
TT 9759 "Yo'q, lekin menga yoqa boshladi." VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_TUTO_RODRIC_KILL_OK_002__M__1
TT 9760 "Vaqtimiz yo'q, Amisiya! Qani, yur!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_WAITING_FOR_AMICIA_001__M__1
TT 9761 "Bu yerdan chiqib ketishimiz kerak! Shu yerda o'lmoqchimisan?" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_WAITING_FOR_AMICIA_002__M__1
TT 9762 "Nima qilyapsan? Qani tezroq, bu yerda qamalib qolmasimizdan oldin!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_WAITING_FOR_AMICIA_003__M__1
TT 9763 "Hey, nima balo qilyapsan o'zi? Bu yerda qolsang qovurilib ketasan!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_WAITING_REMINDER_001__M__1
TT 9764 "Qimirlanglar! Bu yerdan chiqib ketishimiz kerak!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_WAITING_REMINDER_002__M__1
TT 9765 "Bunga vaqtimiz yo'q! Yur!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_WAITING_REMINDER_003__M__1
TT 9766 "Ketdik... Bu yerda uzoq qolib ketdik!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__CHATTER_WAY_TO_GO_002__M__1
TT 9767 "Juda past... Yiqilib ketmasligi uchun tagiga nimadir qo'yishimiz kerak." VO__RODRIC__CH7__HELPER_BLOCKED_001__M__1
TT 9768 "Amisiya, uning mash'alasi..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__HELPER_EXTINGUISH_TORCH__M__1
TT 9769 "Bunga ishonganing va tezroq qaytganing ma'qul - ular har soniyada bu yerda bo'lishi mumkin!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__RTC_STYX_002__M__1
TT 9770 "Yo'q... Imkonimiz yo'q." VO__RODRIC__CH7__RTC_STYX_004__M__1
TT 9771 "Bo'ldi yetar. Qani yur! Bu tomonga!" VO__RODRIC__CH7__RTC_STYX_008__M__1
TT 9772 "Mana! Seni ogohlantirishim kerak - biroz kuyik isini beryapti..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_004__M__1
TT 9773 "Rodrik... Lekin shhh..." VO__RODRIC__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_006__M__1
TT 9774 "Xo'sh, qornim judayam och. Yana kim och?" VO__RODRIC__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_011__M__1
TT 9775 "Men temirchiman, bilasanmi... Bu mening birinchi kuyishim emas." VO__RODRIC__CH7__RTC_THE_BOOK_017__M__1
