TT 9784 "Hmm, xavfli ko'rinadi. Hozircha chetlab o'tamiz." VO__RODRIC__CH8__CHATTER_CORRIDOR__M__1
TT 9785 "Ooh, shuni his qilyapsanmi?" VO__RODRIC__CH8__CHATTER_CORRIDOR_001__M__1
