TT 9797 "Hamma narsani tushunmasam ham... Bu yerda hammasi yaxshi bo'ladi deb o'ylayman." VO__RODRIC__CH8__CHATTER_GO_TO_FRESCO_004__M__1
TT 9798 "Men kerakmanmi?" VO__RODRIC__CH8__CHATTER_LUCAS_003__M__1
