TT 10189 "VO__SERVANT_M3__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_LIGHT__M__1" VO__SERVANT_M3__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_LIGHT__M__1
TT 10190 "VO__SERVANT_M3__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_LIGHT__M__2" VO__SERVANT_M3__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_LIGHT__M__2
TT 10191 "VO__SERVANT_M3__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_LIGHT__M__3" VO__SERVANT_M3__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_LIGHT__M__3
TT 10192 "VO__SERVANT_M3__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_LIGHT__M__4" VO__SERVANT_M3__GENERIC__ONOM_EFFORT_LIGHT__M__4
TT 10193 "Biz tomondan qancha o'lim bo'lganligi haqida biror fikring bormi?" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BATTLE_001__M__1
TT 10194 "Bu la'nati kalamushlar qayerdan kelyapti o'zi? Bu Valuaning hiylasimi yoki shunga o'xshashmi?" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BATTLE_003__M__1
TT 10195 "Bunga urush aralashishiga o'rin yo'q... Qirol Edvard chekinishga buyruq berishi kerak..." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BATTLE_005__M__1
TT 10196 "Valuaga darsni shunday o'tishadi!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_BOWS_AND_ARROWS_001__M__1
TT 10197 "Ha, lekin bu oson edi. Bu ahmoqlar o'zlarini qurbon qilish maqsadida, o'ylab o'tirmay hujumga o'tishdi." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_BOWS_AND_ARROWS_002__M__2
TT 10198 "Qanday asir shunchalik katta to'lovga arziydi?" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_CAPTAIN_TALK_001__M__1
TT 10199 "Daraxt Ritsariga o'xshaydi! Uning urush davridagi jang qilish qobiliyatlari afsonaviy, lekin u endi Qirol Filippning xizmatida emas..." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_CAPTAIN_TALK_003__M__1
TT 10200 "Nega borib opasiga bir-ikki savol bermaysan? U uyg'ongan bo'lsa kerak." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_CAPTAIN_TALK_005__M__1
TT 10201 "Bu yaramas, zo'r g'alaba bo'ldi, senga aytsam! Giyenn yana Angliyaniki, albatta!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_CASUS_BELLI_001__M__1
TT 10202 "Ulardan qutulish uchun senga faqat mash'ala kerak! Xayr, kalamushlar!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_CASUS_BELLI_003__M__1
TT 10203 "Buni to'qiyapsan..." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_CASUS_BELLI_005__M__1
TT 10204 "Yaxshi... og'zingni yum..." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_CASUS_BELLI_007__M__1
TT 10205 "Nima? Hoy!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_DECOY_002__M__1
TT 10206 "Endi nima? Ularni ushla! Men bu ikkisi bilan shug'ullanaman!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_DECOY_005__M__1
TT 10207 "Janglar oralig'ida kutish qanday azob... Va anavi yerdagi ikkitasi o'z kamonlari bilan tinimsiz valdirashyapti... huh... Ular meni jinniga aylantirishadi..." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_GUARD_ABOUT_ARCHERS__M__1
TT 10208 "Bu kemiruvchilarni jinim suymaydi... Va senga murda bilan uymalanishdan boshqa qiladigan yaxshiroq ishing yo'qmi!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_GUARD_PATROL_START__M__1
TT 10209 "Hali ham hech narsa yo'q! Uning lagerni tark etmaganiga ishonching komilmi?" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIER_REPORT_002__M__1
TT 10210 "Yoyilinglar! Bo'lining! Va chodirlarni qidiring!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIER_SEARCHING_001__M__1
TT 10211 "Qayerdan kelding? Yolg'izmisan?" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_THIEVES_CAUGHT_001__M__1
TT 10212 "Biror narsa de, ablah!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_THIEVES_CAUGHT_003__M__1
TT 10213 "Ha ha! Hech qanday imkoniyat yo'q! Men kelgan joyda qaroqchilarni joyida qatl qilamiz!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_THIEVES_CAUGHT_006__M__1
TT 10214 "Hoy! Bu nima? U yerda kim bor?" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_THREATENING_GUARD_001__M__1
TT 10215 "Hoy! Bu anavi qiz va uning ukasi! To'xta!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_TWO_SOLDIERS_001__M__1
TT 10216 "Fikrim yo'q, lekin bu menga yoqmayapti. Qarab kelaman!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__CHATTER_TWO_SOLDIERS_2_002__M__1
TT 10217 "Askarlar! Bu yerda muammo bor!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__RTC_BF1_TRANSITION_001__M__1
TT 10218 "Ana! Ular qochib ketyapti!" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__RTC_BF1_TRANSITION_004__M__1
TT 10219 "E! Tur-tur! Nimadir yeb olganing yaxshi! Omading bor, bilasanmi? Sizning oddiy jasad o'g'rilaringiz odatda so'roqsiz qoringa qilich yeydi... Lekin men..." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__RTC_PRISON_001__M__1
TT 10220 "Shu jimjimador taqinchoqlarga ko'zim tushdi... Va mening qondan ko'ra tillani afzal ko'rishim - bu sening omading, Ledi De Run..." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__RTC_PRISON_002__M__1
TT 10221 "O'chir... Qanchalik yaxshi ko'rinsang, to'lov shunchalik yuqori bo'ladi. Tovar biroz ko'proq pachoqlangan bo'lishi mumkin..." VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__RTC_PRISON_004__M__1
TT 10222 "Yaqinda o'zing ko'rasan... Endi shatoyingda emassan, shuning uchun tilingni tiy, tushundingmi?" VO__SOLDIER1__CH4__RTC_PRISON_006__M__1
