TT 10276 "Kimdir biz bilan o'ynashyapti! Uni toping!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH__M__1
TT 10277 "Qani, bo'ldi endi yetarli! Atrofni qidiring!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH__M__2
