TT 10417 "Eh? Bu nima edi?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER__M__7
TT 10418 "Bu nima edi?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER__M__8
TT 10419 "Bu shovqin... Nima edi u?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 10420 "U tovush... nima edi u?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 10421 "Qanaqa shovqin o'zi bu?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 10422 "Jinni emasman, nimadir eshitdim..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 10423 "A?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__5
TT 10424 "Nima?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__6
TT 10425 "Eh? Bu nima edi?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__7
TT 10426 "Bu nima edi?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_AUDIO_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__8
TT 10427 "Siz ham buni ko'rdingizmi? Borib ko'raman." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 10428 "Lekin qanday qilib... Yaqinroqdan qarab kelaman!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 10429 "Bu qanday jodugarlik? Tekshirib kelaman!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 10430 "Bu nima edi? Borib ko'ramiz!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 10431 "Nima balo bo'ldi u?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 10432 "Buning iloji bormi? Bu qanday bo'lishi mumkin?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 10433 "Bunday narsani hech qachon ko'rmaganman... Nima edi u?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 10434 "Yoqildimi? Yoki o'chdimi?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_LIGHT_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 10435 "Bosqinchilarimiz qaytib kelganga o'xshaydi... Men orqaga qaytib tekshirib ko'raman!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 10436 "Bosqinchilarimiz qaytishdi! Borib tekshirib kelaman!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 10437 "Yana ularmi? Qaroqchilar qaytib kelishibdi... Men boraman!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 10438 "Qarab kelaman! Boyagi ablahlar ekaniga pul tikaman!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 10439 "A? Ular qaytib kelishdimi? Ketdik, ko'rib kelamiz..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 10440 "Bu ular bo'lishi aniq! Shoshmay tur, seni topib olgunimcha..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 10441 "Kimdir yana bu atrofda poylab yuripti... Men ularga darsini berib qo'yaman!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 10442 "Oh, demak qaytib keldingizmi? Yaxshi, ketyapman..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_ORPHANS_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 10443 "U qayerdan keldi? Qisirlashmi? Qani ko'raylikchi..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 10444 "Sen ham qisirlagan ovozni eshitdingmi? Qarab kelaman..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 10445 "Qaytaman. Yaqin atrofda qisirlagan tovushga o'xshash narsani eshitdim..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 10446 "Nima deb o'ylaysan, u nima edi? Qurolmi? Qimirlama..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 10447 "O'sha qarsillash qayerdan keldi?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 10448 "Tush ko'ryapmanmi yoki qandaydir qisirlagan ovozni eshitdimmi?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 10449 "Nima balo u? Palahmonmi?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 10450 "Whoa! Bu qanday ovoz?" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SLING_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 10451 "Anavi yerda nimadir bor..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 10452 "Hmm... Bir qarab kelaylik, a?..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 10453 "Shoshma, borib ko'rib kelaman..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__3
TT 10454 "O'ylashimcha ko'rdim... Qarab kelaman!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER__M__4
TT 10455 "Qani ko'raylikchi nimani ko'rarkinmiz..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 10456 "Nimadir bor..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 10457 "Qani borib bir ko'raylikchi." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__3
TT 10458 "Borib tekshirgan ma'qul." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__4
TT 10459 "Ehtiyot bo'l!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__1
TT 10460 "Ko'zni ochib yuring..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__2
TT 10461 "Tavakkal qilma!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__3
TT 10462 "Ehtiyot bo'ling endi!" VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_SUSPICION_WATCHER__M__4
TT 10463 "Sen o'zingga o'zing muammo qidiryapsan..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__1
TT 10464 "Shunchaki vaqtni cho'zyapsan..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__2
TT 10465 "Birinchi senmi? Muammosiz." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__3
TT 10466 "Qimirlama, hozir qaytaman..." VO__SOLDIER1__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__4
TT 10467 "Aytish qiyin... Minglab, aniq. Lekin kalamushlar hisoblashni qiyinlashtirmoqda." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BATTLE_002__M__1
TT 10468 "Yo'q... Kalamushlar Valua qishloqlarini qirib tashladi. Tishlash yoki yuqumli kasallikdan minglab o'lim qayd etildi. Bu ilohiy vabo... Va bu hali faqat boshlanishi." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_ABOUT_THE_BATTLE_004__M__1
TT 10469 "Hoy! Qiz! Qiz!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_ALARM_001__M__1
TT 10470 "Qiz qochib ketdi! Uning qafasi ochiq! Hamma uni qidiryapti!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_ALARM_003__M__1
TT 10471 "Valua bolalari... Ritsar Robert de Running o'g'li va qizi." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_CAPTAIN_TALK_002__M__1
TT 10472 "Bolalarga bu qadar qiziqish juda g'alati." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_CAPTAIN_TALK_004__M__1
TT 10473 "Buyrug'ingizga muntazirmiz!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_CAPTAIN_TALK_006__M__1
TT 10474 "Non va vinomiz tugab boryapti..." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_CHEF_001__M__1
TT 10475 "Jangda g'alaba qozonganimizda har doim bir xil holat - zahiraning yarmi shunchaki yo'qolib qoladi..." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_CHEF_002__M__1
TT 10476 "Orqaga qaytib, biror qishloqni talon-taroj qilishimizga to'g'ri keladi..." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_CHEF_003__M__1
TT 10477 "Qaranglar-qaranglar. O'sha mitti talonchi ablahlarga o'xshaydi!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_GUARDS_RAIDERS_001__M__1
TT 10478 "U shunchaki yosh qiz! U qayerdadir yashirinib yotgan bo'lishi kerak!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIER_SEARCHING_002__M__1
TT 10479 "Mening tomonimdan xabar beradigan hech narsa yo'q!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIER_SEARCHING_003__M__1
TT 10480 "G'ayrat qilinglar yigitlar! Bilaman charchagansizlar! Bilaman biz yetarli emasmiz VA biz hammamiz bu la'nati kalamushlardan uzoq, uzoqlarga ketishni xohlayotganimizni aniq bilaman, lekin ular bizning yigitlar! Ular Angliya uchun jon berishdi! Agar sening o'rningda bo'lganda-chi?... O'zing munosib dafn etilishni xohlagan bo'larding, shunday emasmi? Shunday emasmi? Qani ketdik - Giyenn bizniki!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIERS_AT_WORK__M__1
TT 10481 "To'xta!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_TWO_SOLDIERS_002__M__1
TT 10482 "Bu chinakam daxshat!" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_002__M__1
TT 10483 "Ha, lekin baribir..." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_004__M__1
TT 10484 "Ha... Menimcha sen haqlisan..." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_006__M__1
TT 10485 "Men urinib ko'rishimni xohlaysanmi?" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_008__M__1
TT 10486 "Nega boshqasini sinab ko'rmaysan? Ular hamma joyda to'lib yotibdi..." VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_010__M__1
TT 10487 "Shuning uchun shunchami?... Endi u bilan nima qilmoqchisan?" VO__SOLDIER2__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_016__M__1
