TT 10732 "Nima bo'lgan taqdirda ham, hammangiz o'lasiz..." VO__SOLDIER2__GENERIC__PATROL_TAUNTED__M__4
TT 10733 "'Qiz' deganda nimani nazarda tutyapsan? Qani! Gapir!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_ALARM_002__M__1
TT 10734 "Jin ursin! Yoyiling!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_ALARM_004__M__1
TT 10735 "Eshiklarga qarab turing!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_ALARM_005__M__1
TT 10736 "Kecha ikkita fransuz ritsarini o'ldirganingiz rostmi?" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_BOWS_AND_ARROWS_001__M__2
TT 10737 "To'ppa-to'g'ri boshiga..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_BOWS_AND_ARROWS_001__M__3
TT 10738 "Yomon emas... Lekin biroz o'ngroqqa, ehtimol..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_BOWS_AND_ARROWS_002__M__3
TT 10739 "Ah, quyoshda porlayotgan qahramonlar va ularning zirhlari... Shunchaki zaif nuqtasini topish kerak va GUMP! Oson nishonlar!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_BOWS_AND_ARROWS_003__M__2
TT 10740 "Ajoyib..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_BOWS_AND_ARROWS_003__M__3
TT 10741 "Oh, shundaymi? U yerga qarab ko'r va Giyenn o'sha la'nati kalamushlarniki ekanini ko'rasan!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CASUS_BELLI_002__M__1
TT 10742 "Men ularni ko'rdim, ulardan yuzlab, xuddi iblisdek yerdan chiqib kelyapti! Va agar ular seni tutib olishsa, xayrli tun..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CASUS_BELLI_004__M__1
TT 10743 "Qanday jur'at qilyapsan? Men u yerda edim! O'z ko'zlarim bilan ko'rdim!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CASUS_BELLI_006__M__1
TT 10744 "Yordam bering! Yigitlar! Yordam bering! Qisilib qoldim!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CORNERED_001__M__1
TT 10745 "Ah! Vaqtida!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CORNERED_005__M__1
TT 10746 "Hoy! Hoy, nima qilyapsan? To'xta!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CORNERED_007__M__1
TT 10747 "Meni tashlab ketmang! Yalinaman! Yo'q!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CORNERED_010__M__1
TT 10748 "YO'QQQQQ!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CORNERED_012__M__1
TT 10749 "Qani! Bu kulgili emas. Meni bu yerdan chiqaring! Hoy!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CORNERED_ALT_001__M__1
TT 10750 "Nimaga buncha imillayapsiz? Ulardan qutuling, qani!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_CORNERED_ALT_002__M__1
TT 10751 "Qani ketdik! Bu safar ularning adabini beramiz!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_GUARDS_RAIDERS_002__M__1
TT 10752 "Va oyoqda tik turing! Qafas o'zidan o'zi shunchaki ochilib qolmaydi! Bu Valuaning ishi bo'lishi mumkin!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_HUGO_IN_SIGHT_005__M__1
TT 10753 "Demak, aylanib o'tishga uryapmiz-da, a?" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_LAST_FIGHT_001__M__1
TT 10754 "Chodirlarni! O'sha chodirlarni qidiring!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_MANGING_RESEARCH_001__M__1
TT 10755 "Sharqiy devorlarda bitta jamoa bo'lishini xohlayman!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_MANGING_RESEARCH_002__M__1
TT 10756 "Jin ursin, ishonmayman... Tamom bo'ldik!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_MANGING_RESEARCH_003__M__1
TT 10757 "Hey, bolakay! Seni ozod qilish uchun yaxshigina pul to'landi. Biz seni olib ketishga kelyapmiz. Tez orada bu yerdan uzoqlashasan!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_READY_FOR_NICHOLAS_001__M__1
TT 10758 "Opangni... Biz o'zimiz bilan olib qolamiz shekilli, to'g'rimi bolalar? Ha ha!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_READY_FOR_NICHOLAS_003__M__1
TT 10759 "Hali ham tirikligingga shukur qil... Bu atrofda hamma ham omon qolavermaydi." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_READY_FOR_NICHOLAS_005__M__1
TT 10760 "Askarlar! Hisobot bering!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIER_REPORT_001__M__1
TT 10761 "Undan hech qanday iz yo'q! Balki u hali ham qafaslariga yaqindir!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIER_SEARCHING_004__M__1
TT 10762 "Hech narsani ko'rmayapman! Qimirlang! U shundayligicha chiqib keta olmasdi!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_SOLDIER_SEARCHING_005__M__1
TT 10763 "Sen... Meni qutqardingmi? Oh rahmat... Rahmat..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_SPARED_001__M__1
TT 10764 "Signal?... Yo'q! Yo'q yo'q yo'q! Seni o'tkazib yuborganimni bilishsa meni osishadi... Boraver, men hech narsani ko'rmadim..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_SPARED_003__M__1
TT 10765 "U kim o'zi? Xizmatkoringmi?" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_THIEVES_CAUGHT_002__M__1
TT 10766 "Buni eshitdingmi? Nima balo u? Fransuzlar qarshi hujumga o'tyapti demagin!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_TWO_SOLDIERS_2_001__M__1
TT 10767 "Ehtiyot bo'l!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_TWO_SOLDIERS_2_003__M__1
TT 10768 "Nima balo qilyapsan? Uni qattiqroq ushlab tur!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_001__M__1
TT 10769 "Ah, qani endi, menga faqat uning tishlari kerak..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_003__M__1
TT 10770 "Nima?... Baribir kalamushlar uni yeb qo'yadi..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_005__M__1
TT 10771 "Ah, jin ursin... Qimirlamayapti!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_007__M__1
TT 10772 "Ishonish qiyin!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_009__M__1
TT 10773 "Va nihoyat! Xudoyim!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_015__M__1
TT 10774 "Xo'sh... Bu haqida o'ylab ko'rishim kerak..." VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__CHATTER_YOUR_TEETH_ARE_MINE_017__M__1
TT 10775 "Argh!" VO__SOLDIER3__CH4__ONOM_LAST_BREATH__M__1
