TT 11228 "Hoy! Yana bu qanday shaytonlik? Borib ko'ramiz!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH__M__1
TT 11229 "O'ylashimcha, bu yerda jinlarimiz bor! Atrofni qaraymiz!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH__M__2
TT 11230 "Oh! Bundan rohatlanyapsan, shundaymi? Lekin men seni topaman!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH_ALONE__M__1
TT 11231 "Yetar! Bu safar javob berasan, hali ko'rasan!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_AGAIN_SEARCH_ALONE__M__2
TT 11232 "Signalni chaling! Bu yerda kimdir bor!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_ALERT__M__1
TT 11233 "U yerda! Ular u yerda!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_ALERT__M__2
TT 11234 "Hoy! Sening ishing shu yerda tugaydi!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_ALERT_ALONE__M__1
TT 11235 "Oh! Barcha o'lgan do'stlarimiz uchun tovon to'laysan!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_ALERT_ALONE__M__2
TT 11236 "Orqaga qayt! Hozir!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_ALERT_BLOCKED__M__1
TT 11237 "Va ushladim! Sen uchun hammasi shu yerda tugaydi!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_CAPTURE__M__1
TT 11238 "Bu nima edi?" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT__M__1
TT 11239 "Bu qayerdan... Qayerdan keldi bu?" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT__M__2
TT 11240 "Bu yoqqa keling! Menga hozirgina nimadir tegdi!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH__M__1
TT 11241 "Hey bolalar, kimdir bizga o'q uzyapti!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH__M__2
TT 11242 "Bundan qochib qutula olmaysan!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH_ALONE__M__1
TT 11243 "Qayerdasan, iflos qo'rqoq?..." VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_HIT_SEARCH_ALONE__M__2
