TT 11248 "Nima balo...?" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_REACTION__M__2
TT 11249 "Yaxshi..." VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME__M__1
TT 11250 "Jiddiy hech narsa emas..." VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME__M__2
TT 11251 "Hech narsa, xuddi oldingidek... Yaxshi, postlarimizga qaytamiz!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME_AGAIN_SPOTTER__M__1
