TT 11253 "Yana ko'zimga ko'rindimi? Yaxshi, pozitsiyangizga qayting." VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME_AGAIN_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 11254 "Yana hech narsa... Qani, joyingga qayt..." VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME_AGAIN_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
TT 11255 "Aniq hech narsa yo'q..." VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME_SPOTTER__M__1
TT 11256 "Bu yerda ko'rishga hech narsa yo'q!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME_SPOTTER__M__2
TT 11257 "Hech narsa yo'q... Tushunmayapman..." VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__1
TT 11258 "Hech narsa... Mayli..." VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_RESUME_SPOTTER_ALONE__M__2
