TT 11263 "Men sizlarni topaman. Bunga shubha qilmang!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_ALONE__M__1
TT 11264 "Bo'ldi, yetar. Iningdan chiq!" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_ALONE__M__2
TT 11265 "Ular hozir qayerda?" VO__VILLAGER_M2__GENERIC__PATROL_SEARCH_ANSWER__M__1
